 ["Checked via C_UnitAuras.AuraIsBigDefensive. Occurrence only."] = "透過 C_UnitAuras.AuraIsBigDefensive 檢查。僅在發生時觸發。",
 ["Chime"] = "鐘鳴",
 ["Choose the addon display language. Automatic follows the game client. Missing translations use English. Changes apply after /reload."] = "選擇插件顯示語言。「自動」將跟隨遊戲客戶端語言。缺失的在地化文字將退回顯示為英文。變更在重載介面 (/reload) 後生效。",
 ["Choose whether gamepad menu navigation and group communication produce controller vibration."] = "選擇控制器選單導覽與隊伍溝通是否產生控制器震動。",
 ["Choose your planned class & role, and configure offensive and defensive combat feedback."] = "選擇你規劃的職業與職責，並設定進攻與防禦戰鬥回饋。",
 ["Clears any vibration still in flight when the controller disconnects."] = "當控制器斷開連線時，清除所有尚未結束的震動序列。",
 ["Click"] = "喀噠",
 ["Click to open settings"] = "點擊以開啟設定",
 ["Climbs this motor slowly from silence to %d%% power over %d seconds, "] = "使該馬達從靜音緩慢攀升至 %d%% 功率，歷時 %d 秒，",
 ["Close"] = "關閉",
 ["Combat"] = "戰鬥",
 ["Combat and life state"] = "戰鬥與生命狀態",
 ["Combat texture"] = "戰鬥材質",
 ["Combo point gained"] = "獲得連擊點數",
 ["Combo points, resource cap, execute range, kick alert, boss telegraphs, burst cooldowns"] = "連擊點數、資源上限、斬殺血量區間、斷法提示、首領預警、爆發冷卻技能",
 ["Commanding protection. High threat alerts, mitigation tracking, crowd control, and kick windows. Silences non-combat clutter."] = "掌控戰局的防禦守護。高仇恨警告、減傷追蹤、控場效果與斷法時機。靜音非戰鬥環境雜音。",
 ["Companion tools"] = "配套工具",
 ["Competitive & Baseline"] = "競技與基礎",
 ["Complements rather than duplicates a \"resource full\" cue — this ticks on every point, not just the cap. Reads UnitPower(\"player\", Enum.PowerType.ComboPoints) via UNIT_POWER_UPDATE, firing only when the count increases — confirmed live 2026-09-16 that this event also fires on the drop back to 0 after a finisher, so an unfiltered version would tick on that reset too. An ability that grants more than one point in a single event ticks once, not once per point — a simplification, not confirmed against every point-granting ability."] = "互補而非重複「資源全滿」提示——此項在獲得每一點時發出微震，而不僅僅在達到上限時觸發。透過 UNIT_POWER_UPDATE 讀取 UnitPower(\"player\", Enum.PowerType.ComboPoints)，僅在點數增加時觸發——已於 2026-09-16 實機確認，施放終結技後點數歸零時該事件亦會觸發，因此未過濾的版本在重設歸零時也會發出微震。在單一事件中賦予多點點數的技能僅會微震一次，而非每點微震一次——此為簡化設計，尚未針對所有獲得點數的技能逐一驗證。",
 ["Configure tactile rewards for exploring Azeroth and sensory spatial awareness for targeting."] = "設定探索艾澤拉斯的觸覺回饋，以及用於選取目標的空間感知震動。",
 ["Confirmation popup appeared"] = "確認彈出視窗出現",
 ["Confirmation popup closed"] = "確認彈出視窗關閉",
 ["Confirmed live 2026-09-17: PLAYER_ENTER_COMBAT/PLAYER_LEAVE_COMBAT specifically track the auto-attack toggle, not the broader in-combat state combatEnter/combatLeave already cover — kept as its own cue pair rather than merged with autoRepeatStart/Stop, since melee and ranged are a different event pair on a different frame."] = "已於 2026-09-17 實機確認：PLAYER_ENTER_COMBAT/PLAYER_LEAVE_COMBAT 專門追蹤自動攻擊的開關，而非 combatEnter/combatLeave 已涵蓋的整體戰鬥狀態——由於近戰與遠程屬於不同框架上的不同事件對，因此保留為獨立提示對，未與 autoRepeatStart/Stop 合併。",
 ["Confirmed live 2026-09-17: START_AUTOREPEAT_SPELL/STOP_AUTOREPEAT_SPELL fire reliably on this client. See meleeAttackStart for the separate melee equivalent."] = "已於 2026-09-17 實機確認：START_AUTOREPEAT_SPELL/STOP_AUTOREPEAT_SPELL 在此客戶端上穩定觸發。獨立的近戰對應項目請參閱 meleeAttackStart。",
 ["Confirmed live 2026-09-17: UNIT_SPELLCAST_SUCCEEDED fires with spellID 75 once per arrow — a genuine per-shot signal, not a prediction. Melee auto-attack has no equivalent: the traditional swing-timer technique reads the combat log, and this same session confirmed COMBAT_LOG_EVENT_UNFILTERED errors on registration for an addon frame under Midnight, full stop. See weaponSwingMain/weaponSwingOff below for the estimated (not measured) melee equivalent, built anyway with that limitation stated plainly. Hunter-specific; other classes' ranged auto-repeat (Shoot, wands) untested."] = "已於 2026-09-17 實機確認：UNIT_SPELLCAST_SUCCEEDED 在每支箭射出時以法術 ID 75 觸發一次——這是真實的單發射擊訊號，而非預估。近戰自動攻擊沒有類似機制：傳統揮擊計時器依賴讀取戰鬥紀錄，而同次實機測試已完全證實 Midnight 架構下插件框架註冊 COMBAT_LOG_EVENT_UNFILTERED 會直接報錯。請參閱下方的 weaponSwingMain/weaponSwingOff，此為近戰的預估（非實測）對應項目，在明確說明此限制的前提下構建。獵人專用；其他職業的遠程自動重複攻擊（射擊、魔杖）尚未測試。",
 ["Confirmed live, 2026-09-15: COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE's DAMAGE_CRIT/SPELL_DAMAGE_CRIT fires when you are crit, not when you land one — the reverse of this cue's original name and description. The `critLanded` id and COMBAT category are kept as-is rather than renamed, so this stays the same saved preference for anyone who already toggled it."] = "已於 2026-09-15 實機確認：COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE 的 DAMAGE_CRIT/SPELL_DAMAGE_CRIT 是在你受到致命一擊時觸發，而非你造成致命一擊時——與此提示原本的名稱和描述相反。為維持已調整過設定的玩家相容性，`critLanded` ID 與 COMBAT 分類維持原樣未予重新命名。",
 ["Confused or possessed"] = "迷惑或被心控",
 ["Continuous atmospheric vibration matching the current weather (rain, snow, sandstorm) and its intensity."] = "與當前天氣（雨、雪、沙塵暴）及其強度相符的持續環境氛圍震動。",
 ["Continuous magical hum that builds during casts and channels steadily through your hands."] = "施法與引導期間持續產生的魔法嗡鳴，在手中平穩增強。",
 ["Continuous textures"] = "持續質感",
 ["Control & Threat"] = "控場與仇恨",
 ["Controller"] = "控制器",
 ["Controller Interactions"] = "控制器互動",
 ["Controller UI"] = "控制器介面",
 ["Controller UI & Window Feedback"] = "控制器介面與視窗回饋",
 ["Controller battery low"] = "控制器電量不足",
 ["Controller calibration"] = "控制器校準",
 ["Controller connected"] = "控制器已連線",
 ["Controller disconnected"] = "控制器已斷開連線",
 ["Controllers differ in which motors they have, and the game never reports whether a vibration actually happened. Nothing can detect this for you, so you have to feel it.\n\nPick a mode from the **Mode to test** dropdown near the top of the panel and press **Play**. Try a few — sharp ones, sustained ones, textures. Pay attention to which ones you can feel clearly, which are faint, and which do not arrive at all.\n\nIf some were missing or silent, check two places:\n\nThe **Vibration schema** dropdown near the top of the panel. A schema decides which motor each pulse drives, and swapping it works around a controller that only drives one of them.\n\nThe **Controller calibration** page. Real motors need a minimum amount of power just to start spinning (their breakaway floor). If quiet cues vanish entirely, use the **Ramp** tool there to calibrate your motor floors and balance their strength."] = "各款控制器配備的馬達不盡相同，且遊戲本體從不回傳震動是否已實際觸發。系統無法代為偵測，因此必須由你親手感受。\n\n請從面板頂部附近的**測試模式**下拉選單中挑選一個模式，然後按下**播放**。多嘗試幾種——清脆型、持續型、質感型。請留意哪些能清晰感知、哪些偏弱，以及哪些完全沒有反應。\n\n若發現部分提示消失或無感，請檢查以下兩處：\n\n面板頂部附近的**震動配置**下拉選單。配置決定每個脈衝由哪個馬達驅動，切換配置可解決僅支援單一馬達的控制器問題。\n\n**控制器校準**頁面。實體馬達需要最低電力門檻才能起轉（即起轉門檻）。若微弱的提示完全感受不到，請使用該處的**爬升測試**工具校準馬達起轉門檻並平衡彼此強度。",
