 ["Create"] = "建立",
 ["Create a new editable custom profile that starts as an exact copy of %s."] = "建立一個新的可編輯自訂設定檔，初始內容為 %s 的完整複本。",
 ["Create a new profile from Registry.lua's stock defaults and switch to it."] = "根據 Registry.lua 的內建預設值建立新設定檔並切換至該設定檔。",
 ["Create a new profile that starts as an exact copy of the one in use, and switch to it. The two are independent from the first edit."] = "建立一個以目前使用設定為完整複本的新設定檔並切換至該設定檔。從初次編輯起兩者即完全獨立。",
 ["Create editable copy"] = "建立可編輯複本",
 ["Create..."] = "建立...",
 ["Crest froth & spray"] = "浪頭泡沫與飛沫",
 ["Crisp high-frequency motor vibration applied right as the wave crest reaches peak amplitude. Fades out smoothly when submerged."] = "在波峰達到最大振幅的瞬間觸發清脆的輕震馬達震動。潛入水中時平滑淡出。",
 ["Cue index"] = "提示索引",
 ["Curated starting setups balanced for specific roles and playstyles. Unlike an empty configuration, each profile prioritizes the tactile signals most critical to that activity while filtering out background noise.\n\n|cffffd100Dungeons & Raids|r prioritize high signal-to-noise: threat loss, defensive mitigations, interrupt windows, and spell completion ticks take precedence.\n|cffffd100World Immersion|r profiles emphasize atmospheric game-feel: footstep weight by armor type, mount strides, swimming resistance, weather changes, and exploration.\n|cffffd100PvP|r provides pure tactical radar with zero ambient distraction.\n\nTip: Click |cffffd100Set for Spec|r to bind any profile to your active talent specialization, or customize auto-switch rules on the |cffffd100Profiles|r page."] = "專為特定職責與遊玩風格調配的精選起始設定。與空白配置不同，每個設定檔皆優先強化對該活動最關鍵的觸覺訊號，同時過濾背景雜訊。\n\n|cffffd100地城與團隊副本|r 優先提供高訊噪比反饋：仇恨遺失、防禦減傷、斷法時機與施法完成微震享有最高優先級。\n|cffffd100世界沉浸|r 設定檔強調環境氛圍體感：依護甲類型區分的腳步重量、坐騎奔馳、游泳阻力、天氣變化與探索體驗。\n|cffffd100PvP|r 提供純粹的戰術雷達，毫無環境干擾。\n\n提示：點擊 |cffffd100套用至專精|r 可將任何設定檔綁定至你當前啟用的天賦專精，或在 |cffffd100設定檔|r 頁面自訂自動切換規則。",
 ["Cycles per second, if you turn the swell on below. 0.15 is roughly one slow rise and fall every seven seconds. Deliberately far slower than the stroke rate above — two layers sharing a frequency read as one sensation instead of two."] = "若在下方開啟湧浪，代表每秒週期數。0.15 大約等於每七秒一次緩慢的升起與落下。刻意設定為遠慢於上方的划水頻率——若兩個圖層共用同一頻率，會被感知為單一震感而非雙層震感。",
 ["Damage taken"] = "承受傷害",
