 ["Default"] = "預設",
 ["Default (Balanced Baseline)"] = "預設 (平衡基準)",
 ["Default profiles"] = "預設設定檔",
 ["Defensive"] = "防禦",
 ["Defensive Combat & Threat Feedback"] = "防禦戰鬥與仇恨回饋",
 ["Deflect"] = "格擋",
 ["Delete"] = "刪除",
 ["Delete profile \"%s\"? This can't be undone."] = "確定刪除設定檔「%s」？此操作無法復原。",
 ["Delete the profile in use. Every rule naming it is cleared, so those scopes fall through to the next one down. Built-in profiles can't be deleted."] = "刪除目前使用的設定檔。所有指定此設定檔的規則皆會被清除，因此這些作用範圍將順延至下一個設定檔。內建設定檔無法刪除。",
 ["Delete this profile"] = "刪除此設定檔",
 ["Delete..."] = "刪除...",
 ["Detect"] = "偵測",
 ["Detected via the global cooldown (spell 61304 ticking), not a per-ability read — so it only fires for abilities that trigger the GCD, and fires once per GCD even if what you pressed doesn't share a name with it. Off by default — this is the one idea in the whole catalogue that genuinely competes for channel time during a pull. Try it, but it's not for everyone."] = "透過全域冷卻時間（法術 61304 觸發）偵測，而非讀取個別技能——因此僅在觸發 GCD 的技能使用時產生提示，且每個 GCD 僅觸發一次，即使你按下的技能名稱不同也是如此。預設關閉——這是整個目錄中唯一會在拉怪開戰時真正搶占聲道時間的想法。不妨嘗試看看，但並不適合所有人。",
 ["Device"] = "裝置",
 ["Directory of all %d vibration cues in Pulse, in alphabetical order. Click any entry to jump directly to its controls."] = "Pulse 中所有 %d 個震動提示的目錄，按字母順序排列。點擊任何項目可直接跳轉至其控制選項。",
 ["Disable All"] = "全部停用",
 ["Disable all cues"] = "停用所有提示",
 ["Disable all cues in profile"] = "停用設定檔中的所有提示",
 ["Disable every vibration cue in the active profile in one sweep for quiet testing or building a profile from scratch."] = "一鍵停用目前使用中設定檔的每個震動提示，用於靜音測試或從零開始建構設定檔。",
 ["Disabled"] = "已停用",
 ["Disarmed"] = "被繳械",
 ["Discordant combat spam"] = "混亂的戰鬥雜訊",
 ["Dismounted"] = "下坐騎",
 ["Displays a shortcut button on the edge of your minimap for quick access to settings and toggling vibration."] = "在小地圖邊緣顯示捷徑按鈕，以便快速開啟設定與切換震動開關。",
 ["Distinct from this addon's own \"Gold looted\"/\"Item obtained\" (World category) — this is Tremor's original item-award cue, kept alongside rather than merged, since the underlying events differ."] = "與此插件自身的「拾取金幣」／「獲得物品」（世界分類）有所區別——此為 Tremor 原創的物品獎勵提示，因底層事件不同而並列保留而非合併。",
 ["Distinctiveness"] = "辨識度",
 ["Distinguished from cancelling by Blizzard's own `isCancelled` flag, which it sets before ending the selection — so a cancel never counts as a choice."] = "透過暴雪原生的 `isCancelled` 標記與取消操作區分開來，該標記在結束選取前設定——因此取消絕不會被計為確認選擇。",
 ["Distinguished from craftStopped by whether the cast actually succeeded, which Core/CastActivity.lua tracks across the cast lifecycle rather than guessing from one event. Untested."] = "與 craftStopped 的區別在於施法是否實際成功，Core/CastActivity.lua 會在整個施法生命週期中追蹤，而非僅憑單一事件猜測。尚未測試。",
 ["Does nothing on a specialisation with no secondary resource. Expect it to fire often on a class that refills constantly, such as a rogue rebuilding combo points. Not a duplicate of this addon's own \"Combo point gained\" above — that ticks per point, this fires once on reaching the cap for any of the seven candidate resources."] = "對沒有次要資源的天賦專精無效。在資源持續回復的職業（例如盜賊累積連擊點數）上會頻繁觸發。並非重複本插件上方的「獲得連擊點數」提示——後者在獲得每點時微震，此項則是在七種候選資源中的任一種達到上限時觸發一次。",
 ["Double Tap"] = "雙擊",
 ["Doubles as the catch-all: a loss-of-control type this addon does not recognise — a new one added by a patch — fires this generic cue instead of being silently dropped."] = "兼作通用後備處理：若插件無法識別某種失去控制類型（例如更新檔新增的類型），將觸發此通用提示，而非被靜默忽略。",
 ["Dragonriding / Skyriding thrust"] = "飛龍騎術 / 馭龍術推進",
 ["Draw"] = "拉弓",
 ["Drift"] = "漂移",
 ["Drive this motor at half power for a second and a half, bypassing every setting on this page and every schema. If you feel nothing here, this channel does not work on your controller and no amount of tuning below will change that."] = "繞過本頁所有設定與震動配置，以半數功率驅動此馬達 1.5 秒。若此處完全感受不到震動，代表此聲道在你的控制器上無法運作，下方進行任何微調都無法改變此結果。",
 ["Drowning damage"] = "溺水傷害",
