 ["Equipment"] = "裝備",
 ["Estimator only, and ignored while the real event is in use. Recalculates the predicted next swing when you parry an incoming attack (real formula: reduces remaining time by 40% of weapon speed, floored at 20%)."] = "僅供估算，在真實事件使用時會被忽略。當你招架敵方攻擊時重新計算下一次揮擊預估（真實公式：縮短剩餘時間 40% of 武器速度，下限為 20%）。",
 ["Every character"] = "所有角色",
 ["Every cue, its intensity and \"feels like\" shape, your profiles, per-mode motor and timing tuning, controller calibration, the mode tester and the guide — all of it is in Pulse's own window.\n\nIt draws itself rather than living as pages in this panel, which is what lets it build only what you are looking at instead of every control in the addon at every login."] = "所有提示、強度與「體感觸感」波形、設定檔、各模式馬達與節奏微調、控制器校準、模式測試器與導引手冊——全都在 Pulse 獨立視窗中。\n\n該視窗採自主繪製，而非嵌入在此面板頁面中，因此每次登入時僅建構你當前檢視的內容，無需載入插件的所有控制項。",
 ["Everything under the Accessibility headings is imported from Tremor, this addon's sibling — the same events, the same triggers, built for telling you about things you'd otherwise have to see, like a stun landing or your cast breaking.\n\nOne thing did not carry over: Tremor plays one cue at a time and makes the most urgent one win, on the reasoning that a late or blended signal is worse than none. Pulse doesn't work that way — everything here can layer together, which is what makes the movement and combat textures feel good, but it means an accessibility cue can arrive blended with something else rather than standing alone the way it would in Tremor.\n\nIf precise, unambiguous accessibility signals matter more to you than game-feel texture, Tremor on its own is built specifically for that and doesn't have this tradeoff. The two are not meant to run at the same time."] = "「無障礙」標題下的所有內容皆引進自本插件的姐妹作 Tremor——相同的事件、相同的觸發器，專為提示原本必須依賴視覺的狀況而構建，例如昏迷命中或施法中斷。\n\n有一點並未沿用：Tremor 每次僅播放一個提示，並以最緊急的訊號優先，其理由在於延遲或混合的訊號比沒有訊號更糟。Pulse 的運作方式則不同——這裡的所有訊號都可以疊加融合，這正是讓移動與戰鬥質感體驗出色的關鍵，但這也意味著無障礙提示可能會與其他震動混合傳遞，無法像在 Tremor 中那樣獨立分明。\n\n如果你認為精確、明確的無障礙訊號比遊戲體感更為重要，Tremor 本身就是為此專門打造的，且沒有這種權衡妥協。這兩個插件不應同時啟用。",
 ["Evoker-only in practice. It stays registered for every class and simply never fires for the others."] = "實際上僅適用於喚魔師。它對所有職業保持註冊狀態，但對其他職業絕不觸發。",
 ["Excessive combat telegraph alarms"] = "過度的戰鬥預警警報",
 ["Experience gained"] = "獲得經驗值",
 ["Experimental"] = "實驗性",
 ["Experimental (game-feel)"] = "實驗性（遊戲手感）",
 ["Experimental. Listens for the client spellcast event of Windfury Attack (Spell ID 25504). Dependent on the server emitting UNIT_SPELLCAST_SUCCEEDED for item proc extra attacks."] = "實驗性功能。監聽風怒攻擊（法術 ID 25504）的客戶端施法事件。依賴伺服器為物品觸發的額外攻擊發送 UNIT_SPELLCAST_SUCCEEDED。",
 ["Experimental. Measures the interval between consecutive main-hand swings. Extra attacks arrive well under 50% of weapon speed without needing combat log access. Confirmed working on WoW Forever."] = "實驗性功能。測量連續主手揮擊之間的時間間隔。額外攻擊抵達時間遠低於 50% of 武器速度，無需存取戰鬥紀錄。已在 WoW Forever 上確認運作正常。",
 ["Experimental: watches whichever spells the Cooldown Manager's Essential category shows, not a hardcoded list. The exact live \"just became ready\" signal was never independently confirmed before this shipped — built on the same C_Spell.GetSpellCooldown transition-tracking this file already uses for the GCD heartbeat."] = "實驗性功能：監控冷卻管理器「核心」(Essential) 分類中顯示的所有法術，而非固定寫死的清單。在發布前尚未實機獨立確認精確的「剛準備就緒」訊號——本功能基於此檔案中已用於 GCD 心跳脈動的相同 C_Spell.GetSpellCooldown 狀態轉換追蹤機制建構。",
 ["Falling"] = "漸弱",
 ["Fast attack time constant used specifically for discrete impacts, clicks, and strikes. Gives snappy transients without making sustained immersion textures harsh."] = "專用於獨立撞擊、點擊與打擊的快速起振時間常數。提供俐落乾脆的暫態響應，同時避免持續沉浸震感變得生硬刺手。",
