 ["Feel crafting"] = "製造體感",
 ["Feel this texture"] = "體驗此震感",
 ["Feels like"] = "體感觸感",
 ["Feels like: "] = "體感觸感：",
 ["Feels like: %s"] = "感覺類似：%s",
 ["Find breakaway floor"] = "尋找起轉門檻",
 ["Fires as an empowered cast of yours begins and ends."] = "在你的蓄力施法開始與結束時觸發。",
 ["Fires at most "] = "最多觸發 ",
 ["Fires at most %s."] = "最多觸發 %s。",
 ["Fires for a craft that stopped without succeeding — moving, being interrupted, or cancelling. Untested."] = "在製造物品未成功而停止時觸發——例如移動、被打斷或手動取消。尚未測試。",
 ["Fires for any summon confirmation dialog, not only a player summoning you."] = "在出現任何召喚確認對話框時觸發，不僅限於其他玩家召喚你。",
 ["Fires for every interaction window, including the ones with their own opening cue. Untested."] = "在每個互動視窗開啟時觸發，包含具有自身開啟提示的視窗。未經測試。",
 ["Fires from GUILDBANKFRAME_OPENED or from the interaction manager's GuildBanker type, whichever this client sends. Untested."] = "由 GUILDBANKFRAME_OPENED 或互動管理員的 GuildBanker 類型觸發，取決於此客戶端發送的事件。未經測試。",
 ["Fires on BAG_OVERFLOW_WITH_FULL_INVENTORY, UI_ERROR_MESSAGE (inventory full error) and when free bag slots drop to zero."] = "當發生 BAG_OVERFLOW_WITH_FULL_INVENTORY、UI_ERROR_MESSAGE（物品欄已滿錯誤）以及剩餘背包格位降至零時觸發。",
 ["Fires on BAG_UPDATE_DELAYED when total free bag slots decrease. Complements Item obtained (which tracks ITEM_PUSH fly-in loot animations)."] = "當總剩餘背包格位減少時，於 BAG_UPDATE_DELAYED 事件觸發。作為「獲得物品」（追蹤 ITEM_PUSH 拾取飛入動畫）的補充。",
 ["Fires on BAG_UPDATE_DELAYED when total free bag slots increase while not interacting with a merchant, bank, or mail."] = "當未與商人、銀行或信件互動且總剩餘背包格位增加時，於 BAG_UPDATE_DELAYED 事件觸發。",
 ["Fires on BANKFRAME_CLOSED, GUILDBANKFRAME_CLOSED, or interaction manager banker hide."] = "在 BANKFRAME_CLOSED、GUILDBANKFRAME_CLOSED 或互動管理員隱藏銀行職員時觸發。",
 ["Fires on LOOT_READY when gathering loot is ready."] = "當採集拾取準備就緒時，於 LOOT_READY 事件觸發。",
 ["Fires on PLAYER_TARGET_DIED."] = "在收到 PLAYER_TARGET_DIED 事件時觸發。",
 ["Fires on SPELL_ACTIVATION_OVERLAY_GLOW_SHOW for procs such as Clearcasting, Nightfall, Overpower, Revenge, Riposte, or Art of War."] = "當觸發節能施法、暮光、壓制、復仇、反擊或戰爭藝術等觸發效果時，於 SPELL_ACTIVATION_OVERLAY_GLOW_SHOW 事件觸發。",
 ["Fires on input, so it also fires for casts that then fail. That is intentional: this is an input-acknowledgement cue, not a success cue."] = "在按鍵輸入時觸發，因此對於隨後失敗的施法也會觸發。這是有意設計的：本提示為輸入確認提示，而非成功提示。",
 ["Fires on money changes with an open bank frame or guild bank money update."] = "當銀行視窗開啟期間金錢變動，或公會銀行金錢更新時觸發。",
 ["Fires on taxi takeoff when control is lost to the flight master mount."] = "在搭乘飛行坐騎起飛並將控制權交給飛行管理員坐騎時觸發。",
 ["Fires on the change itself, not on every flag update."] = "僅在狀態本身發生改變時觸發，而非在每次標記更新時觸發。",
 ["Fires on the crossing into low, not repeatedly while low."] = "僅在耐久度跌入過低區間時觸發一次，而非在低耐久狀態下重複觸發。",
 ["Fires on the yellow informational messages the game shows in the top centre of the screen."] = "在螢幕頂部中央顯示黃色遊戲提示訊息時觸發。",
 ["Fires once when the controller's battery drops into its low or critical range."] = "當控制器電量降至偏低或告急範圍時觸發一次。",
 ["Fires only when a queue enters the ready-to-enter state, not on every status update."] = "僅在排隊進入「可進入」狀態時觸發，而非在每次狀態更新時觸發。",
 ["Fires specifically when a channelled spell of yours is cut short by an interrupt, not when it simply ends."] = "專門在你引導的法術被斷法中斷時觸發，而非正常引導結束時。",
 ["Fires the instant you press a cast, before the server has confirmed it."] = "在按下施法的瞬間觸發，無需等待伺服器確認。",
 ["Fires upon arrival at destination when player control is restored."] = "在抵達目的地且玩家角色控制權恢復時觸發。",
 ["Fires when a battleground or arena queue is ready to enter."] = "戰場或競技場排隊準備就緒可進入時觸發。",
 ["Fires when a boss encounter begins."] = "首領戰開始時觸發。",
 ["Fires when a boss encounter ends, in victory or in a wipe."] = "首領戰結束時觸發（無論是獲勝還是滅團）。",
 ["Fires when a channelled spell of yours ends, whether it ran to completion or was cut short."] = "當你引導的法術結束時觸發，無論是引導完成還是被中途打斷。",
 ["Fires when a class or profession trainer's window opens."] = "當職業或專業技能訓練師視窗開啟時觸發。",
