 ["Fires when a dungeon or raid finder queue pops and the accept dialog appears."] = "當地城或團隊搜尋器佇列配對成功並出現接受對話框時觸發。",
 ["Fires when a flight master's map opens."] = "飛行管理員地圖開啟時觸發。",
