 ["Fires when someone offers you a resurrection and the accept dialog appears."] = "有人對你施放復活且彈出接受復活對話框時觸發。",
 ["Fires when someone summons you and the accept dialog appears."] = "有人召喚你且彈出接受召喚對話框時觸發。",
