 ["High-clarity encounter triage. Critical raid mechanics, debuffs, boss abilities, and personal survival alerts with world clutter silenced."] = "高清晰度的首領戰決策指引。關鍵團隊副本機制、減益效果、首領技能與個人生存警報，同時靜音大世界雜訊。",
 ["High-motor ceiling at full gliding speed. Only audible while actually gliding."] = "全速滑翔時的輕震馬達上限。僅在實際滑翔時可感知。",
 ["High-tempo physical execution. Snappy combo points and resource spenders, execute range alerts, boss telegraphs, and kick windows."] = "快節奏的物理打擊。俐落的連擊點數與能量消耗、斬殺血量區間警報、首領預警與斷法時機。",
 ["Hit with a critical strike"] = "受到致命一擊",
 ["Honor gained"] = "獲得榮譽",
 ["Hooks Blizzard's shared tab plumbing (TabSystemMixin:SetTab, TabSystemOwnerMixin:SetTab, PanelTemplates_SetTab). Filtered on those functions' own `isUserAction` argument where they provide one, so a panel setting its own tab as it opens stays silent and only a tab YOU changed fires. Two known gaps: PanelTemplates_SetTab is the legacy path and has no such flag, so a few older panels may still fire on open; and the two mixin hooks only reach panels created AFTER Pulse loads, because Mixin() copies function references onto a frame at creation. Most big tabbed panels are load-on-demand and so are covered, but anything built before this addon isn't. Expect this one to be patchy."] = "攔截暴雪共用的分頁標籤底層機制 (TabSystemMixin:SetTab, TabSystemOwnerMixin:SetTab, PanelTemplates_SetTab)。在有提供參數的情況下，根據這些函式自帶的 `isUserAction` 參數進行過濾，因此面板在開啟時自動設定分頁會保持靜音，只有由你主動切換的分頁才會觸發。兩個已知限制：PanelTemplates_SetTab 屬於舊版路徑且無此標記，因此少數較舊的面板在開啟時仍可能觸發；此外，兩個 Mixin Hook 只能涵蓋在 Pulse 載入「之後」建立的面板，因為 Mixin() 會在框架建立時將函式參照複製至框架上。大多數具備分頁的大型面板皆為隨選載入 (Load-on-Demand) 因而受到涵蓋，但在本插件之前構建的內容則無法支援。請預期此功能在某些介面上可能偶有缺漏。",
 ["Hooks StackSplitFrame:UpdateStackText."] = "攔截 StackSplitFrame:UpdateStackText。",
 ["Hostile target under reticle"] = "準星下的敵對目標",
 ["How far a motor has to move before the addon bothers telling the client about it. Raise it to cut the number of calls; too high and slow fades turn into visible steps. Shared by every channel — this is a call-rate setting, not a motor property."] = "馬達數值變動達到多少幅度時，插件才會向客戶端發送更新。調高此值可減少呼叫次數；若設得太高，緩慢淡出會變成肉眼可見的階梯狀跳動。所有聲道共用——此為呼叫頻率設定，而非馬達硬體屬性。",
 ["How far the hum swells either side of its baseline. 0 is a flat hold."] = "嗡鳴聲圍繞基線起伏漸強的幅度。0 表示平穩維持。",
 ["How fast the wingbeat-style undulation cycles."] = "振翅式起伏波動的循環速率。",
 ["How long this motor takes to fall back toward silence. Too high and consecutive taps blur into one buzz; too low and sustained textures sound chopped. 0.028 reproduces the engine's old behaviour at 60fps."] = "此馬達衰減回靜音狀態所需的時間。數值過高會使連續敲擊模糊成一片蜂鳴；過低則會使持續質感顯得斷斷續續。0.028 可重現 60fps 下遊戲引擎的舊版行為。",
 ["How long this motor takes to reach a new, stronger level during continuous textures. Higher is softer and more gradual; lower is snappier. 0.075 reproduces the engine's old behaviour at 60fps."] = "在持續質感運作期間，此馬達達到更強新強度等級所需的時間。數值愈高愈柔和漸進；數值愈低愈俐落乾脆。0.075 可重現引擎在 60fps 下的舊版運作表現。",
 ["How many seconds before the scripted moment this fires."] = "在腳本時刻到來前多少秒觸發。",
 ["How often the hum swells, in cycles per second. 0.30 is roughly one slow breath every three seconds."] = "嗡鳴漸強的頻率（每秒週期數）。0.30 大約相當於每三秒一次緩慢的呼吸。",
 ["How often the lub-dub repeats while the warning stays active. Higher is more urgent; lower is less annoying. Independent of the screen flash's own (fixed, ~57 BPM) rate — this is a separate timer, not synced to it."] = "當警告持續處於作用狀態時，雙擊心跳節奏 (lub-dub) 的重複頻率。數值愈高愈緊迫急促；數值愈低愈不易受到干擾。獨立於螢幕閃爍本身的固定頻率（約 57 BPM）——此為獨立計時器，並未與其強制同步。",
 ["How pronounced each stroke is against its own baseline. Higher values (0.80-1.0) allow the counterweight to physically spin down during the glide phase between strokes. 0 is a flat drag with no rhythm at all."] = "每個划水動作相對於其基線的明顯程度。較高的數值（0.80-1.0）允許配重塊在兩次划水之間的滑行階段自然減速。0 為完全沒有節奏的單調拖曳。",
 ["How sharply the high motor ramps in with speed. 1 = linear, higher = holds back more until near max speed. Only audible while actually gliding."] = "輕震馬達隨速度增長而爬升的陡峭程度。1 = 線性，數值愈高 = 接近極速前抑制愈多。僅在實際滑翔時可感知。",
 ["How steady the low motor stays regardless of speed. Only audible while actually gliding."] = "無論速度如何，重震馬達保持平穩的程度。僅在實際滑翔時可被感知。",
 ["How strong the hum gets by the moment a regular cast completes. Only audible if \"Casting texture\" is also enabled on its own tab."] = "一般施法完成瞬間嗡鳴達到的強度。僅在所屬分頁中同時啟用「施法質感」時方可感知。",
 ["How strong the stealth hum is overall. Meant to sit just at the edge of perception — if you notice it as a vibration rather than a presence, it is too high."] = "潛行嗡鳴的整體強度。旨在維持在感知邊緣——如果你明確感覺到它是一陣震動而非一種沉浸存在感，則代表數值設得過高。",
 ["Hum"] = "嗡鳴",
