 ["Hydrodynamic water drag that scales as you swim forward through rivers and seas."] = "在河流與海洋中向前游泳時隨速度變化的流體動力阻力。",
 ["INPUT_DEVICE_INTERFACE_TRANSITION, carrying newMode/oldMode. This event is FOREVER-ONLY — it was not found anywhere in the retail Midnight archive used for comparison, so don't expect this cue to do anything on retail. Fires on any transition in either direction; the payload would let it be split into separate entered/left cues later if that's worth having."] = "INPUT_DEVICE_INTERFACE_TRANSITION，帶有 newMode/oldMode 參數。此事件為 WoW Forever 獨佔——在用於比對的正式服 Midnight 封存檔中未見其蹤影，因此請勿預期此提示能在正式服運作。雙向切換時皆會觸發；其附帶的酬載資料日後若有需要，可再拆分為獨立的進入／離開提示。",
