 ["Instants and completed casts arrive on the same event, so \"Cast succeeded\" has always fired for both. Core/CastActivity.lua tells them apart by whether a START was seen first; this is the instant half. Leave \"Cast succeeded\" off if you want only one of the two. Untested."] = "瞬發法術與完成施法皆透過同一個事件傳遞，因此「施法成功」一直以來對兩者都會觸發。Core/CastActivity.lua 根據是否先偵測到 START 事件來區分兩者；此項為瞬發法術部分。若你只想保留其中之一，請關閉「施法成功」。尚未測試。",
