 ["Low motor holds a steady presence, floored so it's never silent while gliding; high motor eases in from near-silent toward thrillPeak as speed climbs, shaped by thrillCurve."] = "重震馬達保持持續存在感，設有起轉門檻使其在滑翔時永不沉寂；輕震馬達則隨著速度提升從近乎無聲平穩過渡至 thrillPeak，受 thrillCurve 曲線調節。",
 ["Low on breath"] = "氣息不足",
 ["Low, irregular micro-pulses — rain, patter."] = "低沉、不規則的微脈衝——雨聲、輕敲聲。",
 ["MEASURED as of 2026-09-21, not estimated. Driven by Forever's PLAYER_SWING event, which carries swingDuration and a MainHand/OffHand/Ranged type, both confirmed non-secret, and which Blizzard's own swing timer consumes. Note this is a SWING, not necessarily a connection — whether it also fires on a miss, dodge or parry is untested, and a \"successful hit\" cue would need a different source. The old weapon-speed estimator is kept as a fallback and engages automatically if the event ever disappears; it predicted swing times from UnitAttackSpeed with a haste cache, range and stun gating and a parry-haste correction, and drifted with nothing to correct against."] = "截至 2026-09-21 為實機測量，非預估值。由 Forever 的 PLAYER_SWING 事件驅動，該事件帶有 swingDuration 以及 MainHand/OffHand/Ranged 類型，兩者皆已確認為非私密值 (Non-Secret)，且暴雪自身的揮擊計時器亦採用此事件。請注意這是「揮擊」(SWING)，不一定代表命中——未命中、閃躲或招架時是否觸發尚未測試，若需要「成功命中」提示則需其他資料來源。舊版武器速度估算器保留為後備方案，並在此事件失效時自動啟用；舊版透過 UnitAttackSpeed 搭配加速快取、射程與昏迷門控以及招架加速修正來預估揮擊時間，且在沒有校正基準的情況下容易產生漂移。",
 ["MUTED"] = "已靜音",
