 ["Mailbox opened"] = "信箱已開啟",
 ["Manage"] = "管理",
 ["Mark floor from ramp"] = "從爬升測試標記起轉門檻",
 ["Master Vibration Strength"] = "主震動強度",
 ["Master switch for all menu, window, tab, and radial controller haptics. Turn off to silence all UI navigation haptics at once while keeping combat and world rumble active."] = "所有選單、視窗、分頁標籤與環形選單控制器觸覺的總開關。關閉可一次靜音所有介面導覽觸覺，同時維持戰鬥與世界環境震動運作。",
 ["Master switch for every loss-of-control cue below. With this off, none of them fire and no loss-of-control events are registered at all."] = "下方所有失去控制提示的總開關。關閉後，所有提示均不會觸發，且完全不會註冊任何失去控制事件。",
 ["Master switch. With this off, nothing registers and nothing costs anything."] = "總開關。關閉後，不註冊任何事件且無任何效能開銷。",
 ["Melee auto-attack started"] = "近戰自動攻擊開始",
 ["Melee auto-attack stopped"] = "近戰自動攻擊停止",
 ["Menu & controller UI haptics"] = "選單與控制器介面觸覺",
 ["Menus & tabs"] = "選單與分頁",
 ["Messages"] = "訊息",
 ["Micro Tap"] = "微點",
 ["Mid breath threshold"] = "中期呼吸門檻",
 ["Minimum severity"] = "最低嚴重度",
 ["Mining"] = "採礦",
 ["Mirrors critLanded's split exactly: HEAL_CRIT on the same personal COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE feed. critLanded's incoming-vs-outgoing direction was independently confirmed live (2026-09-15) for damage; the same direction for heals is inferred by analogy (same feed, same self-scoped design), not separately re-tested — worth confirming live before trusting it's \"you were healed\" rather than \"you landed a heal\" if that distinction matters to you."] = "完全對應 critLanded 的機制劃分：在同一個個人 COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE 資料串流中的 HEAL_CRIT。critLanded 的承受與造成傷害方向已於 2026-09-15 實機獨立確認；治療方向則是類推推斷（相同的資料串流、相同的自身範圍設計），未經單獨重新測試——如果你在乎是「受到治療」還是「造成治療」的差異，建議在信任前先於遊戲中實機驗證。",
 ["Mode to test"] = "待測試模式",
 ["Most specific wins. A scope set to |cffffd100No rule|r has no opinion and lets the one below it decide; with none of them set, Pulse uses Default."] = "最特定的規則優先。若範圍設為|cffffd100無規則|r，則不作設定並由其下層規則決定；若均未設定，Pulse 將使用預設設定檔。",
 ["Most triggers are a **pulse** — something happens, you feel one short burst, then it's gone.\n\nSome are a **texture** instead — a faint, continuous feeling for as long as something is true. Swimming, gliding, casting, riding a flight path, weathering a storm: these fade in in the moment they start and fade out the instant they stop, rather than announcing themselves once. They're built to layer underneath pulses rather than compete with them — a critical hit still lands as a distinct thump even while a casting texture is quietly running underneath it.\n\nMost textures ship switched off, on purpose: a constant hum is a bigger ask than an occasional pulse, and it's worth trying deliberately rather than discovering by accident."] = "大多數觸發器都是**脈衝**——事件發生時，你感受到一陣短促震動，隨後消失。\n\n部分觸發器則是**持續質感**——只要特定狀態持續，就會產生微弱連綿的體感。游泳、滑翔、施法、乘坐飛行路線、歷經暴風雨：這些效果在開始的瞬間淡入，在停止的瞬間淡出，而非只提示一次。它們被設計為疊加在脈衝下方，而非與脈衝相互競爭——即使在施法質感於底層悄然運作時，致命一擊仍會以清晰沉重的重擊傳遞。\n\n大多數持續質感刻意預設關閉：持續的嗡鳴比偶爾出現的脈衝更容易令人疲勞，值得玩家依自身需求刻意開啟嘗試，而非意外開啟。",
 ["Motor & Timing"] = "馬達與節奏",
 ["Mount weight"] = "坐騎重量",
 ["Mounted up"] = "上坐騎",
 ["Mounts & travel"] = "坐騎與旅行",
 ["Movement"] = "移動",
 ["Movement & Travel"] = "移動與旅行",
 ["Multiplies %s's high-motor intensity. 1.0 is the authored default; the top of this slider is where it stops making any further difference."] = "乘以 %s 的輕震馬達強度。1.0 為預設設計值；此滑桿頂端為數值不再產生差異的上限。",
 ["Multiplies %s's low-motor intensity. 1.0 is the authored default; the top of this slider is where it stops making any further difference."] = "乘以 %s 的重震馬達強度。1.0 為預設設計值；此滑桿頂端為數值不再產生差異的上限。",
 ["Multiplies every impact, on top of each profession's own weight. Set it to zero for a craft you feel but never get hit by."] = "在各專業自身比重之上，倍增每次敲擊力度。設為零可保留製造體感但完全消除敲擊感。",
 ["Multiplies every impact, on top of each profession's own weight. Set to zero for a craft you feel but never get hit by."] = "在各專業自身比重之上，倍增每次敲擊力度。設為零可保留製造體感但完全消除敲擊感。",
 ["Multiplies every trigger's intensity. Part of the current profile, not global."] = "按倍率縮放每個觸發器的強度。屬於目前設定檔，非全域設定。",
 ["Multiplies gait strength while mounted, on top of the racial mount's own weight. A kodo is already heavier than a hawkstrider before this touches it."] = "在坐騎本身種族重量的基礎上，倍增騎乘時的步伐強度。在此設定介入之前，科多獸本就比陸行鷹沉重。",
 ["Multiplies the baseline while fully submerged rather than bobbing at the surface, via IsSubmerged(). Set to 1.0 to feel the same either way. UNVERIFIED: IsSubmerged is confirmed present in the client API list, but whether it really distinguishes the two cases here has not been checked live."] = "透過 IsSubmerged() 在完全沒入水中（而非漂浮於水面）時倍增基底震動。設為 1.0 則兩種狀態體感相同。未經實機證實：IsSubmerged 已確認存在於客戶端 API 清單中，但實機上能否確實區分這兩種狀態尚未驗證。",
 ["Multiplies the continuous layer under every craft, on top of each profession's own weight. This is the part you feel for the whole craft rather than the individual blows."] = "在各專業自身比重之上，倍增每次製造底層的持續基底震動。此為你在整個製造過程中持續感受到的部分，而非個別敲擊感。",
 ["NPC emote nearby"] = "附近 NPC 表情動作",
 ["Name the new profile:"] = "為新設定檔命名：",
 ["Naturalistic scout feel. Locomotion, flight gliding, wilderness weather, tracking/stealth cues, world exploration, and bow release."] = "自然系斥候體感。移動步伐、飛行滑翔、荒野天氣、追蹤／潛行提示、世界探索與拉弓放箭。",
 ["Navigation"] = "導覽",
 ["Never miss an important group alert, even while looking away:\n• |cffffffffDirect Whispers:|r Distinct personal communication blip on incoming whispers.\n• |cffffffffParty & Raid Invites:|r Dual-pulse notification when receiving group invitations.\n• |cffffffffQueue Pops & Ready Checks:|r High-priority attention-grabbing pulse when instances are ready."] = "即使視線離開螢幕，也不會錯過重要的隊伍警報：\n· |cffffffff直接密語：|r 收到來信密語時發出清晰獨特的個人通訊提示。\n· |cffffffff隊伍與團隊邀請：|r 收到組隊邀請時發出雙脈衝通知。\n· |cffffffff佇列進場與就緒確認：|r 副本準備就緒時發出高優先級的引人注意脈衝。",
 ["New profile"] = "新增設定檔",
 ["New setups enable casting, crafting, low-health and breath effects. Other effects start off; your saved choices are kept."] = "全新的設定會啟用施法、專業製作、低生命值與呼吸效果。其他效果預設關閉；已儲存的選項將予以保留。",
 ["Next >"] = "下一步 >",
 ["Nintendo Switch Pro"] = "Nintendo Switch Pro",
 ["No legacy event for this one — it arrives only through the interaction manager, so it is silent if this client does not send that. Untested."] = "此項目沒有舊版事件——僅透過互動管理員傳遞，若此客戶端未發送該事件則保持靜音。未經測試。",
 ["No rule"] = "無規則",
 ["Noisy. In a raid this event fires very frequently. Kept for completeness and defaulted off."] = "干擾較多。在團隊副本中此事件觸發極為頻繁。保留以求完整性，預設關閉。",
 ["None (full sensory richness)"] = "無（完全感官豐富度）",
 ["None (stock defaults)"] = "無（初始預設值）",
 ["Not filtered by rarity yet — fires for anything, common items included."] = "尚未按稀有度過濾——任何物品皆會觸發，包括普通物品。",
 ["Note the event name: Forever uses LEARNED_SPELL_IN_SKILL_LINE, not the older LEARNED_SPELL_IN_TAB, which is absent from this client's documentation entirely. Can fire more than once for a single visit to a trainer if you buy several ranks."] = "請注意事件名稱：Forever 使用的是 LEARNED_SPELL_IN_SKILL_LINE，而非舊版的 LEARNED_SPELL_IN_TAB，後者在此客戶端文件中已完全不存在。若造訪訓練師時一次購買多個等級，可能會觸發多次。",
 ["Nothing about these is percussive, so they get the bed alone. Inventing a hammer for enchanting would be inventing a sensation that is not there."] = "這些過程毫無敲擊性質，因此僅提供單純的底層基底震動。為附魔憑空捏造鐵鎚敲擊感，無異於憑空創造現實中不存在的體感。",
 ["OFF BY DEFAULT, and that is deliberate. A rolling swell suggests ocean, and this cue fires in rivers, lakes and canals too, where it would read as wrong rather than as atmosphere — Classic has no wave physics for it to be tracking, so it would be inventing something the world is not doing. Flat presence is the honest default. Raise it if you want a swell anyway; it is a good sensation, just not a true one."] = "預設關閉，且為刻意如此設計。起伏的湧浪容易讓人聯想到海洋，但此提示在河流、湖泊與運河中亦會觸發，在那些水域反而會顯得突兀違和而非增添氛圍——經典版並無可供追蹤的波浪物理系統，因此這等同於捏造遊戲世界中不存在的事物。平穩的沉浸存在感才是忠實的預設值。若你無論如何都想要湧浪感可調高此值；這種體感固然令人愉悅，但並非真實體現。",
 ["ON — option changes and cue firings will print here."] = "開啟——選項變更與提示觸發將在此處輸出。",
 ["Occurrence only, deliberately near-subliminal so it doesn't compete with \"Levelled up\". No size scaling: the amount would need UnitXP diffing and isn't worth the bookkeeping for a cue this quiet."] = "僅觸發事件，刻意設計為極其微弱以避免與「等級提升」衝突。不依數值縮放：讀取獲取量需比對 UnitXP 差值，對如此微弱的提示而言不值得耗費額外效能。",
 ["Ocean Waves & Swell"] = "海浪與海湧",
 ["Ocean waves & swell"] = "海浪與海湧",
 ["Ocean zones only (guessed from zone name)"] = "僅限海洋區域（根據區域名稱推測）",
 ["Off by default and deliberately the faintest cue in the addon: this fires for EVERY NPC you talk to, which in a city is constantly. Try it before leaving it on. Untested."] = "預設關閉，且刻意設計為本插件中最微弱的提示：與任何 NPC 對話時都會觸發，而在城市中對話極其頻繁。建議在保持開啟前先體驗測試。未經測試。",
 ["Off by default and mounted-only by default, on purpose: a texture that plays whenever you move is the most fatiguing thing in this addon and the most likely to make you switch it off wholesale. Uses shaped transient layers with fast-attack kicks and exponential decay to produce crisp, distinct footfalls without motor hum in between. Distinct timbres (boots, hooves, paws, heavy claws/pads, metal) drive both Low (body mass) and High (impact crispness) motors in concert. Speed is read out of combat only and held through a fight; snares and boosts are not tracked there, which is a deliberate trade for never touching a secret value. Goes quiet while swimming, flying, gliding, riding a flight path, or airborne after a jump — each of those has its own cue and footfalls have nothing to add to them."] = "預設關閉且刻意預設僅在騎乘時啟用：只要移動就播放的持續質感是本插件中最容易引起疲勞的設定，也是最容易讓人徹底關閉它的原因。採用具備快速啟動打擊與指數衰減的瞬態波形層，產生清脆分明的腳步聲，且腳步之間沒有多餘的馬達嗡鳴。不同的音色質感（皮靴、蹄鐵、腳爪、重爪／肉墊、金屬）協同驅動低頻重震（身體質量）與高頻輕震（撞擊清脆度）馬達。速度僅在脫離戰鬥時讀取並在戰鬥中保持不變；此處不追蹤緩速與加速效果，這是為了絕不碰觸私密值 (Secret Value) 的刻意取捨。在游泳、飛行、滑翔、搭乘飛行路線或跳躍滯空時自動靜音——這些狀態皆有各自獨立的提示，腳步聲無需疊加其中。",
 ["Off by default — a continuous texture, not a notification."] = "預設關閉——屬於持續質感，而非單次通知。",
 ["Off by default, layers with \"Low health\" rather than replacing it — same relationship as breathWarning/breathTexture. Same mechanism and same fullscreen-panel caveat as lowHealthWarning above. The shape itself is a code-level switch (Modules/Health.lua's HEARTBEAT_STYLE: smooth glow, flash-synced lub-dub, or an independently-timed lub-dub), not exposed here — flash-synced won out by feel. The knock's own gap/duration/intensity used to be four sliders here; fixed as plain constants in Modules/Health.lua once this exact combination was confirmed to feel right (2026-09-15)."] = "預設關閉，與「低生命值」重疊而非取代它——關係類似於 breathWarning/breathTexture。具備與上方 lowHealthWarning 相同的機制與全螢幕面板注意事項。心跳波形本身為程式碼層級的開關（Modules/Health.lua 中的 HEARTBEAT_STYLE：平滑漸變、閃爍同步的撲通心跳，或獨立計時的撲通心跳），未於此處開放調整——實測體驗由閃爍同步勝出。心跳敲擊本身的間隔/持續時間/強度過去曾是此處的四個滑桿；在確認此特定組合手感最佳後已於 Modules/Health.lua 中固定為常數 (2026-09-15)。",
 ["Off by default, layers with \"Low on breath\" rather than replacing it."] = "預設關閉，與「氣息不足」重疊而非取代它。",
 ["Off by default. Suppresses \"Casting texture\" for the length of a craft so the two do not layer into one lumpy sensation. The profession is read by id from the recipe (C_TradeSkillUI.GetProfessionInfoByRecipeID), so no name matching and no localisation problem — but that field is documented nilable, and anything that does not resolve falls back to a generic work rhythm rather than going quiet. Gathering is NOT covered: swinging a pick at an ore node is not a recipe and has no recipe id. Per-profession toggles and strengths are on the Crafting page. Entirely untested."] = "預設關閉。在製造物品期間壓制「施法質感」，避免兩者重疊成混亂臃腫的體感。專業技能是透過配方法術 ID 讀取 (C_TradeSkillUI.GetProfessionInfoByRecipeID)，因此沒有名稱匹配或在地化相容性問題——但該欄位在文件中標註為可為 nil，任何無法解析的情況都會退回通用工作節奏而非保持靜音。採集「不」包含在內：對著礦脈揮動十字鎬並非配方，也沒有配方法術 ID。各專業技能的開關與強度位於「製造」頁面。完全尚未測試。",
 ["Off means swings come from Forever's own PLAYER_SWING event — a real per-swing signal, confirmed non-secret and proven live. On forces the old prediction built from weapon speed instead. You should not need this: if Blizzard ever removes the event, Pulse detects that and falls back on its own. It exists so a patch that changes the event's BEHAVIOUR rather than removing it still leaves you a working cue."] = "關閉代表揮擊訊號來自 Forever 原生的 PLAYER_SWING 事件——真實的單次揮擊訊號，已確認為非私密值且經實機證實。開啟則強制使用依武器速度構建的舊版預估。通常你不需要開啟此項：若暴雪未來移除該事件，Pulse 會自動偵測並切換至後備方案。保留此選項是為了因應若日後補丁改變了該事件的「行為」而非將其移除時，仍能為你提供可運作的提示。",
 ["Offensive"] = "進攻",
 ["Offensive Combat Haptics"] = "進攻戰鬥觸覺",
 ["Okay"] = "確定",
 ["One cue for all four edges (top, bottom, left, right), observed via SmartNavigation's directional edge callbacks while keeping button selection isolated via polling to prevent execution taint. Standard default is off."] = "單一提示涵蓋所有四個邊緣（上、下、左、右），透過 SmartNavigation 的方向邊緣回呼進行監聽，同時藉由輪詢隔離按鈕選取以防止執行污染 (taint)。標準預設為關閉。",
 ["One cue for both directions, same reasoning as the navigation edge cue — a motor can't tell you which way you went."] = "雙向共用一個提示，原因與導覽邊緣提示相同——馬達無法傳達你移動的具體方向。",
 ["One full-bodied hit on both motors."] = "雙馬達上產生一次飽滿有力的敲擊。",
 ["One long, sombre pulse when a spirit healer's window opens."] = "靈魂醫者視窗開啟時，產生一次漫長而沉鬱的脈衝。",
 ["One pattern for every kind of refusal. May also do nothing inside dungeons and raids."] = "所有拒絕操作皆採用同一震動模式。在地城與團隊副本內也可能不產生任何動作。",
 ["One sharp, heavy impact — fast attack, fast decay."] = "一次清脆沉重的撞擊——快速起振，快速消退。",
 ["One strong, sustained pulse."] = "一次強烈而持續的脈衝。",
 ["One sustained pulse."] = "一次持續脈衝。",
 ["Only audible if \"Riding a flight path\" is also enabled on its own tab."] = "僅在專屬分頁中同時啟用「搭乘飛行路線」時才有感知。",
 ["Only while mounted"] = "僅在騎乘時",
 ["Open Pulse settings"] = "開啟 Pulse 設定",
 ["Other"] = "其他",
 ["Other crafting"] = "其他製造",
 ["Overall gasp-knock strength — fixed per beat, not scaled by danger (2026-09-16: a danger-scaled lub/dub risked landing under the controller motor's own minimum activation threshold at low danger, causing missing \"dub\" knocks live). Urgency comes from heartRateCalm/heartRateCritical instead. Only audible if \"Underwater breath texture\" is also enabled on its own tab."] = "整體喘息撞擊強度——每次心跳固定，不隨危險程度縮放（2026-09-16：隨危險程度縮放的怦怦跳動在低危險時有低於控制器馬達自身最低啟動門檻的風險，導致實戰中遺失後半拍「咚」的敲擊）。緊迫感改由平靜心率／危急心率表現。僅在所屬分頁中同時啟用「水下呼吸質感」時方可感知。",
 ["Overall heave amplitude of the oceanic swell. Sets the physical displacement intensity of the slow motor."] = "海浪起伏的整體振幅。設定重震馬達的物理位移強度。",
 ["Overall intensity"] = "整體強度",
 ["Overall strength of each footfall before speed and state scaling."] = "在速度與狀態縮放前，每次腳步著地的整體強度。",
 ["Overall strength. Meant to sit at the edge of perception — if you notice it as a vibration rather than as being submerged, it is too high. Inherits the old idleFloatAmplitude, which was live-tuned to 0.04."] = "整體強度。旨在維持在感官察覺的邊緣——若你感覺它是一陣震動而非置身水下，代表強度偏高。繼承了舊版 idleFloatAmplitude，實機調校設定為 0.04。",
 ["Overdrive kick"] = "超驅衝量",
 ["Overdrive time (s)"] = "超驅時間 (秒)",
 ["Overwrite every motor's calibration with the selected controller's starting values. Ask first, because this discards any trimming you have already done."] = "以所選控制器的起始值覆蓋所有馬達校準設定。執行前會先確認，因為這將捨棄你已完成的所有微調。",
 ["Own motor"] = "獨立馬達",
 ["PLAYER_ALIVE also fires when you release to a graveyard, so this can fire while you are still a ghost."] = "釋放靈魂到墓地時也會觸發 PLAYER_ALIVE，因此當你仍處於鬼魂狀態時可能觸發此提示。",
 ["PLAYER_SOFT_ENEMY_CHANGED, an occurrence-only event with no payload at all — there is nothing here to come back secret. Fires on the soft target changing, which is not the same as actually targeting something; that's still \"Target changed\" on the Target & Focus page. Expect this to fire often while sweeping the camera through a crowd."] = "PLAYER_SOFT_ENEMY_CHANGED，一個完全沒有裝載資料的純觸發事件——此處沒有任何會作為私密數值回傳的內容。在柔性目標改變時觸發，這與實際選取目標不同；後者仍是「目標與專注目標」頁面上的「目標已改變」。鏡頭掠過人群時預期會頻繁觸發。",
 ["PLAYER_SOFT_FRIEND_CHANGED, occurrence-only, no payload. Worth pairing with the hostile cue above only if you can tell two TICKs apart — if not, give one of them a different shape with its own \"Feels like\" dropdown."] = "PLAYER_SOFT_FRIEND_CHANGED，僅事件觸發，無額外資料。只有當你能分辨兩種不同的「TICK」提示震動時，才建議與上方的敵對提示搭配使用——若無法分辨，請在各自的「體感觸感」下拉選單中為其指定不同的震動形態。",
 ["PLAYER_SOFT_INTERACT_CHANGED. Unlike its two siblings this one DOES carry a payload (oldTarget/newTarget GUIDs) and is flagged SecretWhenUnitIdentityRestricted in Blizzard's own docs, so this cue deliberately reads none of it and fires on the occurrence alone. Probably the most useful of the three: it's the one that says \"there is something here\" while you're looking around."] = "PLAYER_SOFT_INTERACT_CHANGED。與另外兩個相關事件不同，此事件確實帶有酬載資料（oldTarget/newTarget 的 GUID），且在暴雪自身的文件中被標示為 SecretWhenUnitIdentityRestricted，因此本提示刻意完全不讀取任何內容，僅在事件發生時單純觸發。可能是三者中最實用的一個：它能在你環顧四周時傳達「這裡有目標」的訊息。",
 ["PLAYER_SOFT_TARGET_INTERACTION. Fires when native gamepad/action interact executes on the current soft target."] = "PLAYER_SOFT_TARGET_INTERACTION。當原生控制器／動作互動對當前軟性目標執行時觸發。",
 ["PULSE QUICK SETUP"] = "PULSE 快速設定",
 ["Paced ranged rhythm with melee-weaving support. Auto-shot timing, weapon swings, pet status, trap triggers, and boss mechanics."] = "節奏穩定的遠程循環，支援穿插近戰揮擊。自動射擊時機、武器揮擊、寵物狀態、陷阱觸發與首領戰鬥機制。",
 ["Pacified or school-locked"] = "處於被安撫或法術系別封鎖狀態",
 ["Page switches"] = "頁面總開關",
 ["Paladin"] = "聖騎士",
 ["Pans left and right footfalls across the Low and High motors so the stride walks across your hands. Turn off for centered dual-motor footfalls."] = "將左腳與右腳的步伐分別分配至重震與輕震馬達，讓行走的步調在你的雙手之間交替流轉。關閉則改為居中的雙馬達同步腳步震動。",
 ["Party invite"] = "隊伍邀請",
 ["Party leader changed"] = "隊長已變更",
 ["Passively polled by observing IsEnabled() on the currently focused element. Fires if the element becomes disabled while focused."] = "透過監測目前焦點元素的 IsEnabled() 進行被動輪詢。若焦點元素在處於焦點狀態時變為停用則觸發。",
 ["Passively polled from GamepadRadial:IsShown() to eliminate EventRegistry callback taint during radial menu activation."] = "被動輪詢 GamepadRadial:IsShown()，以消除環形選單啟用時 EventRegistry 回呼引發的介面污染 (taint)。",
 ["Passively polled from GamepadRadial:IsShown(). Picking a segment that opens a panel also closes the radial."] = "被動輪詢 GamepadRadial:IsShown()。選取開啟面板的扇區時亦會關閉環形選單。",
 ["Passively polled from SmartNavigation focus state. Fires when controller navigation gains focus on a UI element."] = "被動輪詢 SmartNavigation 焦點狀態。當控制器導覽在介面元素上取得焦點時觸發。",
 ["Passively polled from SmartNavigation focus state. Fires when controller navigation releases focus back to world control."] = "被動輪詢 SmartNavigation 焦點狀態。當控制器導覽釋放焦點並交還世界控制時觸發。",
 ["Passively polled from SmartNavigation's currentButton every 0.05s to eliminate execution taint when gamepad mode is toggled. Fires on real focus changes rather than stick motion. Gated on gamepad UI being active."] = "每 0.05 秒被動輪詢 SmartNavigation 的 currentButton，以消除切換控制器模式時的執行污染 (taint)。僅在真實焦點改變而非搖桿晃動時觸發。受限於控制器介面處於作用狀態。",
 ["Passively polled via GetUIPanel every 0.05s to eliminate UIParentPanelManager execution taint on protected frames."] = "每 0.05 秒透過 GetUIPanel 被動輪詢，避免受保護框架產生 UIParentPanelManager 執行污染。",
 ["Passively polled via GetUIPanel every 0.05s. Detects when major UI panels are dismissed without callback taint."] = "每 0.05 秒透過 GetUIPanel 被動輪詢。在不產生回呼污染的前提下偵測主要介面面板的關閉。",
 ["Passively polled via GroupTargeting.isTargetingActive to eliminate execution taint when targeting stops or gamepad mode is toggled."] = "透過 GroupTargeting.isTargetingActive 被動輪詢，以消除目標選取停止或切換控制器模式時的執行污染 (taint)。",
 ["Passively polled via GroupTargeting.isTargetingActive. Fires when the group targeting modifier is released."] = "透過 GroupTargeting.isTargetingActive 被動輪詢。在放開隊伍目標組合鍵時觸發。",
 ["Patter"] = "淅瀝",
 ["Patter frequency (Hz)"] = "雨點輕拍頻率 (Hz)",
 ["Perceptual S-Curve"] = "感知 S 曲線",
 ["Performed an emote"] = "做出表情動作",
 ["Personal damage clutter, footsteps, weather, world dialogs"] = "個人受傷雜音、腳步聲、天氣、世界對話",
 ["Physical strikes for weapon swings (main & off hand), auto-shot arrows, ability execution cadence, and completed and instant spellcasts."] = "主手與副手武器揮擊、自動射擊箭矢、技能施放節奏，以及施法完成與瞬發法術的實體打擊感。",
 ["Physical tool strikes: anvil hammer strokes, mining pickaxe impacts, tailoring stitches."] = "物理工具敲擊：鐵砧錘擊、採礦鎬擊打、裁縫縫紉針線。",
 ["Pick a mode to test below."] = "在下方選擇要測試的模式。",
 ["Picked up an item"] = "拿起物品",
 ["Ping placed"] = "標記已放置",
 ["Play"] = "播放",
 ["Play "] = "播放 ",
 ["Play %s right now with whatever's currently set on its sliders above."] = "立即以其上方滑桿的目前設定播放 %s。",
 ["Play a few seconds of this texture at its current intensity. Module-driven preview reproducing authentic physical dynamics and configured intensity."] = "以目前強度播放數秒該震感。模組驅動的預覽能夠真實還原物理動態與配置強度。",
 ["Play this cue exactly as it is configured right now — its own intensity, and its own \"Feels like\" shape if you changed it. Works whether or not the cue is switched on, and needs a connected controller."] = "完全按照當前配置播放此提示——包含其個別強度，以及若有修改過的「體感觸感」波形。無論該提示是否已開啟皆可運作，需要連線的控制器。",
 ["Polled from StaticPopup1..4's IsShown() four times a second rather than hooked. StaticPopup_Show is called from all over Blizzard's UI by code that then touches protected frames, and this addon already has one taint incident from exactly that shape (Modules/ControllerUI.lua's ActivateRadial note). Untested."] = "每秒對 StaticPopup1..4 的 IsShown() 輪詢四次而非使用 Hook。暴雪介面各處程式碼常呼叫 StaticPopup_Show 隨後接觸受保護框架，本插件曾發生過完全相同情況的污染事件（詳見 Modules/ControllerUI.lua 的 ActivateRadial 註解）。未經完整測試。",
 ["Presence floor (low)"] = "最低存在感底限（重震）",
 ["Present whether or not you are moving, and it does not read your speed at all, so it keeps working while speed comes back as a secret value. Drives the SLOW motor, whose large mass is what buoyancy actually feels like, leaving the sharp one to \"Swimming resistance\" — so the two never collide. Floating gives you this alone."] = "無論你是否移動皆會存在，且完全不讀取你的移動速度，因此即使速度值作為私密數值回傳時也能正常運作。驅動重震馬達（較大的配重塊質量正是浮力的真實手感），將輕震馬達留給「游泳阻力」——使兩者永不衝突。單純漂浮時僅會觸發此震感。",
 ["Priest"] = "牧師",
 ["Prints every option you change and every cue that actually fires to chat, in real time. Same as /pulse debug — off by default, and resets to off on /reload since it's a testing aid, not a saved preference."] = "在對話框中即時輸出你變更的每個選項以及實際觸發的每個提示。等同於 /pulse debug——預設關閉，且在 /reload 後重設為關閉，因為此項僅為測試輔助工具，而非儲存的偏好設定。",
 ["Produces no vibration — the controller is gone. Turning it off changes nothing you can feel: the engine clears in-flight vibration whenever it loses the device, because it has to."] = "不產生震動——控制器已失去連線。將其關閉不會產生任何體感差異：因為每當遺失裝置時，引擎本就必須清除傳輸中的震動。",
 ["Profession skill increased"] = "專業技能提升",
 ["Profession window opened"] = "專業技能視窗已開啟",
 ["Professions with a rhythm"] = "具有節奏的專業技能",
 ["Professions without one"] = "無節奏的專業技能",
 ["Profile"] = "設定檔",
 ["Profiles"] = "設定檔",
 ["Profiles and automatic rules"] = "設定檔與自動規則",
 ["Progression"] = "角色成長",
 ["Progressive low build leading to a sharp high break."] = "重震漸強積聚，隨後爆發清脆的輕震碎裂。",
 ["Pull / glide balance"] = "拉力 / 滑翔平衡",
 ["Pulse"] = "Pulse",
 ["Pulse Beat"] = "脈搏",
 ["Pulse Haptics"] = "Pulse Haptics",
 ["Pulse is engineered to drive both the Low (heavy counterweight) and High (sharp tick) rumble motors in concert across all supported gamepads.\n\nVibration schemas define how logical haptic roles map to physical motors: **Standard Rumble** routes low-frequency signals to the heavy motor and high-frequency signals to the sharp motor; **High Motor Only** or **Low Motor Only** collapse signals when a motor is mechanically silent; and **Swapped / Inverted** reverses the mapping for custom grips."] = "Pulse 專為所有受支援控制器協同驅動重震馬達（偏心重錘）與輕震馬達（快速微震）而設計。\n\n震動配置定義邏輯觸覺角色如何對應至實體馬達：**標準震動**將低頻訊號傳遞至重震馬達，高頻訊號傳遞至輕震馬達；**僅輕震馬達**或**僅重震馬達**可在某個馬達機械故障無聲時合併訊號；而**對調／反轉**則反轉對應關係以配合自訂握姿需求。",
 ["Pulse is using |cffffd100%s|r, because a rule is set for %s."] = "Pulse 正在使用|cffffd100%s|r，因為已為 %s 設定了規則。",
 ["Pulse provides purpose-built default profiles engineered for specific roles and activities — browse them on the dedicated **Default profiles** page:\n\n• **Dungeon & Raid Roles** (Tank, Healer, Melee DPS, Caster DPS, Hunter) prioritize high signal-to-noise: threat loss, mitigations, kick windows, and spell completion ticks take priority over ambient clutter.\n• **World Immersion** (Melee, Caster, Ranged) maximizes atmospheric game-feel: footstep weight by armor type, mount strides, swimming resistance, weather, and exploration.\n• **PvP** delivers pure tactical radar with zero ambient distraction.\n\nOn the **Profiles** page, you can configure automatic rules that switch profiles on the fly when you change talent specializations, or create custom copies of any default profile. To protect combat performance, any profile switch requested while fighting is safely deferred until combat ends."] = "Pulse 提供專為特定職責與活動設計的預設設定檔——可在專屬的**預設設定檔**頁面瀏覽：\n\n· **地城與團隊職責**（坦克、治療者、近戰輸出、法系輸出、獵人）優先考量高訊噪比：仇恨遺失、減傷技能、斷法時機與施法完成提示震動優先於環境瑣碎雜音。\n· **世界沉浸**（近戰、法系、遠程）最大化環境體感：依護甲類型區分的腳步重量、坐騎奔馳、游泳阻力、天候與探索。\n· **PvP** 提供純粹的戰術雷達，完全摒除環境干擾。\n\n在**設定檔**頁面中，你可以設定切換天賦專精時即時切換設定檔的自動規則，或為任何預設設定檔建立自訂複本。為確保戰鬥流暢度，戰鬥期間請求的任何設定檔切換都將安全延後至戰鬥結束。",
 ["Pulse tunes motor spin-up attack, coast-down release, and breakaway friction to match your physical hardware actuators."] = "Pulse 調校馬達的起轉加速、減速釋放與起轉摩擦力，以精確符合你的實體硬體震動致動器。",
 ["Pulse turns what's happening in the game into controller vibration — landing hard, gliding fast, taking a critical hit, a storm rolling in. It's texture for ordinary play, closer to what a console game's rumble does than to a notification.\n\nIt also carries a second, separate set of controls: a full accessibility toggle set imported from Tremor, this addon's sibling project. Those work the same way Tremor's own cues do — an event happens, one pulse tells you about it — but they share Pulse's channel with everything else here, which is a real difference worth understanding. See \"The Accessibility section\" below."] = "Pulse 將遊戲中發生的事件轉化為控制器震動——沉重著地、高速滑翔、受到致命一擊、暴風雨來襲。這是專為日常遊玩打造的體感質感，更接近遊樂器主機遊戲的震動體驗而非單純通知。\n\n它同時具備第二套獨立控制項：從姊妹專案 Tremor 引進的完整無障礙開關套件。運作方式與 Tremor 自身的提示相同——事件發生時以單次脈衝通知你——但它們與 Pulse 的其他功能共用聲道，這項實質差異值得特別注意。詳見下方的「無障礙功能章節」。",
 ["Pulse: (Engine recorded %d errors. Last error: %s)"] = "Pulse: (引擎記錄了 %d 個錯誤。最後錯誤：%s)",
 ["Pulse: /pulse test <mode>|heartbeat|warningbeat — try one of: "] = "Pulse: /pulse test <mode>|heartbeat|warningbeat —— 推薦嘗試：",
 ["Pulse: activated profile \"%s\""] = "Pulse: 已啟用設定檔「%s」",
 ["Pulse: active profile is \"%s\" (%s)"] = "Pulse: 目前使用中設定檔為「%s」(%s)",
 ["Pulse: all haptic vibrations stopped."] = "Pulse：所有觸覺震動已停止。",
 ["Pulse: bound profile \"%s\" to specialization %s"] = "Pulse: 已將設定檔「%s」綁定至專精 %s",
 ["Pulse: captured %s breakaway floor at %.3f (ramp was at %.3f when clicked)"] = "Pulse：已擷取 %s 起轉門檻為 %.3f（點擊時爬升測試數值為 %.3f）",
 ["Pulse: controller found, but it reports no usable name. Use Generic and Ramp each motor."] = "Pulse：已找到控制器，但未回報可用名稱。請使用通用設定 (Generic) 並對各馬達進行爬升測試。",
 ["Pulse: controller reports itself as \"%s\", which isn't in the list. Use Generic and Ramp each motor."] = "Pulse：控制器回報型號為「%s」，此型號未在清單中。請使用通用設定 (Generic) 並對各馬達進行爬升測試。",
 ["Pulse: could not build settings row %q (%s)"] = "Pulse: 無法建構設定列 %q (%s)",
 ["Pulse: could not build the settings window ("] = "Pulse: 無法建構設定視窗 (",
 ["Pulse: debug "] = "Pulse: 偵錯 ",
 ["Pulse: disabled all %d cues in active profile."] = "Pulse: 已停用目前設定檔中的全部 %d 個提示。",
 ["Pulse: disabled all %d cues in profile \"%s\"."] = "Pulse: 已停用全部 %d 個提示（設定檔「%s」）。",
 ["Pulse: disabled all %d cues in profile %s."] = "Pulse: 已停用全部 %d 個提示（設定檔 %s）。",
