 ["Pulse: this looks like a %s%s. Pick it above, then press Apply."] = "Pulse: 偵測到目前裝置疑似為 %s%s。請在上方選取它，然後按一下套用。",
 ["Purchased item from vendor"] = "向商人購買物品",
 ["Pure competitive reaction. Instant tactical alerts for stuns, silences, disarms, lockouts, panic health warnings, and combat transitions."] = "純粹的競技反應。針對昏迷、沉默、繳械、系別封鎖、危急生命值警告與戰鬥狀態切換的即時戰術警報。",
 ["Pure flavor, sibling to \"Performed an emote\" above. Fires often in busy areas with lots of ambient NPCs — this is opt-in noise, not a curated signal, same as its sibling. Off by default."] = "純屬情境氛圍，與上方的「做出表情動作」為同類功能。在有大量環境 NPC 的繁雜區域會頻繁觸發——此為自選雜訊而非精選訊號，與同類功能相同。預設關閉。",
 ["Pure flavour — nothing depends on it. Untested."] = "僅用於增添氛圍——無任何邏輯依賴它。未經測試。",
 ["Pure novelty. Off by default forever, basically — nobody asked for this one."] = "純屬新奇體驗。基本上永遠預設關閉——畢竟從未有人要求過這項功能。",
 ["Put down an item"] = "放下物品",
 ["Put every motor's strength, floor, timing and curve back to the engine defaults. Doesn't touch cues, per-cue intensity, mode tuning or your schema."] = "將每個馬達的強度、起轉門檻、時序與曲線恢復為引擎預設值。不會影響提示、個別提示強度、模式調校或你的震動架構方案。",
 ["Put the profile in use back to its stock defaults — works on built-ins too, restoring their curated content rather than blank Registry.lua defaults."] = "將使用中的設定檔恢復為初始預設值——對內建設定檔同樣有效，恢復其精心策劃的內容而非空白的 Registry.lua 預設值。",
 ["Puts the stroke on the sharp motor. Turn off (recommended) to route swimming resistance to the heavy motor alongside ambient water, producing deep hydrodynamic drag instead of high-frequency motor buzz."] = "將划水動作分配至輕震馬達。關閉（推薦）可將游泳阻力與環境水體一同路由至重震馬達，產生深沉的流體動力阻力而非高頻馬達蜂鳴。",
