 ["Rate of rain drops and micro-flutter patter."] = "雨滴與細密微顫輕叩的頻率。",
 ["Reading something"] = "正在閱讀",
 ["Reads Blizzard's own default-UI LowHealthFrame (:IsShown()), not UnitHealth — that read is unconditionally secret, and the earlier color-curve attempt was confirmed dead too. LowHealthFrame's widget state is confirmed non-secret in-game instead. Very rarely can also fire for an unrelated reason (a fullscreen UI panel open in combat) — narrow enough to document rather than guard against. No `mode` field: this no longer plays a Core/Modes.lua shape, it drives Engine:Hold directly, same mechanism as lowHealthTexture."] = "讀取暴雪原生介面的 LowHealthFrame (:IsShown())，而非 UnitHealth——後者的讀取在遊戲中絕對屬於私密值 (Secret Value)，且先前嘗試的色彩曲線方式也已確認失效。相反地，LowHealthFrame 的元件狀態已在遊戲中確認為非私密值。極少數情況下可能因無關原因觸發（例如戰鬥中開啟全螢幕介面面板）——此情況極為罕見，僅記錄於文件中而未刻意防範。無 `mode` 欄位：此項不再播放 Core/Modes.lua 波形，而是直接驅動 Engine:Hold，機制與 lowHealthTexture 相同。",
 ["Reads Blizzard's own pre-scripted encounter timeline (C_EncounterEvents), not real-time combat data — pre-computed metadata, not something Secret Values blocks. No confirmed \"targeted at you\" flag: this can say something big is coming, not that it's coming for you specifically."] = "讀取暴雪自身預先腳本化的首領戰時間軸 (C_EncounterEvents)，而非即時戰鬥數據——此為預先計算的元數據，不會被私密值機制阻擋。無已確認的「以你為目標」標記：此提示能告訴你即將發生重大技能，但無法確認是否專門針對你而來。",
 ["Reads CHAT_MSG_RAID_WARNING/MONSTER_YELL/MONSTER_EMOTE/MONSTER_WHISPER, gated on being inside an active encounter (ENCOUNTER_START/END) — never on C_EncounterEvents, so this works even if that namespace's data turns out unreliable. Occurrence-only: says a boss communicated something, not what or whether it's aimed at you. Known false-positive: a player manually using the raid-warning channel during a live pull also fires this — not filtered, since telling a boss-sent raid warning from a player-sent one isn't reliable."] = "讀取 CHAT_MSG_RAID_WARNING/MONSTER_YELL/MONSTER_EMOTE/MONSTER_WHISPER，以處於進行中的首領戰鬥 (ENCOUNTER_START/END) 為門控——絕不依賴 C_EncounterEvents，因此即使該命名空間的數據不可靠也能正常運作。僅提示事件發生：表示首領發出了訊息，但無法判斷內容或是否針對你。已知誤報：在戰鬥中玩家手動使用團隊警告頻道也會觸發此提示——由於無法可靠區分團隊警告是由首領還是玩家發出，因此未予過濾。",
 ["Reads COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE's DAMAGE/SPELL_DAMAGE/DAMAGE_CRIT/SPELL_DAMAGE_CRIT messageTypes rather than UNIT_COMBAT, for no-churn reasons rather than necessity — UNIT_COMBAT's \"WOUND\" mechanism was believed dead (reported not firing 2026-09-15) but was confirmed live and firing on 2026-09-16 after all; this cue already worked on COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE by then, so it wasn't switched back. The suspicion that UNIT_COMBAT has been non-functional since Cataclysm-era patches should not be trusted as settled. Deliberately TICK, not THUD — a routine hit should read as noticeably gentler than critLanded's own pulse, not the same weight repeated constantly. Its own Intensity slider (the generic per-cue one every trigger gets) defaults to 0.3 rather than 1.0, same reasoning: it fires far more often than a crit or a dodge, so it needs to stay in the background rather than compete with them."] = "讀取 COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE 的 DAMAGE/SPELL_DAMAGE/DAMAGE_CRIT/SPELL_DAMAGE_CRIT 訊息類型而非 UNIT_COMBAT，純粹出於避免頻繁變動而非必要——UNIT_COMBAT 的「WOUND」機制曾被認為已失效（2026-09-15 回報未觸發），但在 2026-09-16 最終實機確認仍在正常觸發；當時此提示已在 COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE 上穩定運作，故未再切換回去。關於 UNIT_COMBAT 自浩劫與重生版本以來一直失效的懷疑，不應被視為定論。刻意採用輕觸微震 (TICK) 而非沉重撞擊 (THUD)——常規命中體感應明顯比 critLanded 本身的脈衝柔和，而非不斷重複相同的厚重感。其專屬強度滑桿（每個觸發器皆有的常規單項滑桿）預設為 0.3 而非 1.0，也是出於同樣考量：它的觸發頻率遠高於致命一擊或閃躲，因此需要保持在背景中，避免喧賓奪主。",
 ["Reads COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE's FACTION messageType — same personal combat-text feed critLanded/damageTaken already use, occurrence-only, no amount or faction name read."] = "讀取 COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE 的 FACTION 訊息類型——與 critLanded/damageTaken 使用相同的個人戰鬥文字串流，僅提示事件發生，不讀取數值或陣營名稱。",
 ["Reads COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE's HONOR_GAINED messageType — same personal combat-text feed critLanded/damageTaken already use, occurrence-only, no amount read."] = "讀取 COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE 的 HONOR_GAINED 訊息類型——與 critLanded/damageTaken 使用相同的個人戰鬥文字串流，僅提示事件發生，不讀取數值。",
 ["Reads C_Weather.GetCurrentWeather() in WoW Forever. Modulates micro-flutter for rain, slow crystalline drift for snow, and dual rumble for sandstorms, scaled by weather intensity."] = "在 WoW Forever 中讀取 C_Weather.GetCurrentWeather()。根據天氣強度調整雨天的細密微顫、下雪時的緩慢晶瑩漂移感，以及沙塵暴的雙重隆隆震動。",
 ["Reads GetShapeshiftForm()/UPDATE_SHAPESHIFT_FORM, the player's own state — one generic cue for any change, not split by direction, since forms chain (e.g. Bear -> Cat -> Moonkin) without necessarily passing back through no-form in between."] = "讀取玩家自身狀態 GetShapeshiftForm()/UPDATE_SHAPESHIFT_FORM——任何變更皆採用單一通用提示，不區分切換方向，因為形態之間可連續切換（例如：熊形態 -> 獵豹形態 -> 梟獸形態）而不必先切回無形態狀態。",
 ["Reads HEAL/PERIODIC_HEAL/HEAL_CRIT — same feed and direction caveat as healCrit above. Same TICK/0.3-intensity treatment as damageTaken, for the same reason: this fires far more often than a crit heal, especially under any HoT, so it stays in the background rather than competing with it."] = "讀取 HEAL/PERIODIC_HEAL/HEAL_CRIT——與上方的 healCrit 具有相同的資料串流與方向限制。與 damageTaken 一樣採用輕微微震 (TICK) 與 0.3 強度處理，原因亦同：其觸發頻率遠高於致命治療，尤其在任何持續治療 (HoT) 作用下，因此應保持在背景中，避免干擾主要提示。",
 ["Reads IsStealthed(), the player's own boolean state — not an aura scan, which would be both expensive and liable to return secret values. First cue built on Core/Waves.lua. Untested."] = "讀取玩家自身的布林狀態 IsStealthed()——而非光環掃描，後者開銷龐大且容易回傳私密值。這是第一個建構於 Core/Waves.lua 之上的提示。尚未測試。",
 ["Reads the segment's own IsEnabled() — the same value Blizzard reads to grey the highlight out, so this matches what you see on screen. Fires in place of \"Radial segment changed\", not alongside it."] = "讀取該扇區自身的 IsEnabled()——與 Blizzard 用於將高亮變灰的值完全相同，因此與你在螢幕上看到的完全一致。此提示會替代「環形扇區切換」觸發，而非並列觸發。",
 ["Reads the skill-up chat feed rather than SKILL_LINES_CHANGED, which also fires for unrelated skill-list changes. Occurrence-only, no text parsing — this says a skill went up, not which one or to what. Deliberately light: early profession levelling fires this constantly."] = "讀取技能提升聊天訊息而非 SKILL_LINES_CHANGED（後者亦會在不相關的技能清單變更時觸發）。僅提示事件發生，無文字解析——這表示有技能提升，但不指明是哪一項或提升至多少。刻意設計得輕微：前期升級專業技能時觸發極為頻繁。",
