 ["Repaired equipment"] = "已修復裝備",
 ["Reputation gained"] = "獲得聲望",
 ["Reset"] = "重設",
 ["Reset calibration"] = "重設校準",
 ["Reset every mode's motor and duration multiplier back to 1.0? This can't be undone."] = "是否將所有模式的馬達與持續時間倍率重設回 1.0？此操作無法復原。",
 ["Reset every mode's motor and duration multiplier on this page back to 1.0. Doesn't touch cues, per-cue intensity, or per-trigger mode picks."] = "將本頁面中所有模式的馬達與持續時間倍率重設回 1.0。不會影響提示、個別提示強度或依觸發器設定的模式選擇。",
 ["Reset every motor's strength, floor, timing and curve back to the engine defaults? This can't be undone."] = "是否將每個馬達的強度、起轉門檻、時序與曲線重設為引擎預設值？此操作無法復原。",
 ["Reset motor & timing"] = "重設馬達與節奏",
 ["Reset profile \"%s\" to defaults? Every cue, intensity and mode override in it goes back to stock values. This can't be undone."] = "是否將設定檔「%s」重設為預設值？其中的所有提示、強度以及模式覆寫都將恢復為初始值。此操作無法復原。",
 ["Reset this profile"] = "重設此設定檔",
 ["Reset..."] = "重設...",
 ["Resources"] = "資源",
 ["Response curve"] = "反應曲線",
 ["Resting"] = "休息狀態",
 ["Restricts the gait to mounted travel, where a sustained texture is most welcome. Turn off to feel your own footsteps too — try it before leaving it on."] = "將步伐限制於騎乘旅行，此時持續質感最令人舒適。關閉可同時感受自己的步行腳步——在決定保持開啟前不妨先行嘗試。",
 ["Resurrection offered"] = "受到復活邀請",
 ["Reverses the rumble motors: heavy low-frequency thuds go to the High motor, and sharp high-frequency ticks go to the Low motor. For reverse-wired or custom controller grips."] = "反轉震動馬達：沉重的低頻撞擊傳遞至輕震馬達，清脆的高頻微震傳遞至重震馬達。適用於接線相反或自訂握姿的控制器。",
 ["Rewards"] = "獎勵",
 ["Rhythmic footsteps on foot and hoofbeat cadence while mounted, weighted by armor class."] = "步行的節奏腳步與騎乘時的蹄聲節拍，依據護甲類型給予不同權重。",
 ["Riding a flight path"] = "搭乘飛行路線",
 ["Rising"] = "漸強",
 ["Rising heartbeat pulse that quickens and intensifies as your breath meter runs low underwater."] = "在水下隨著呼吸計量條耗盡而加速並增強的漸強心跳脈衝。",
 ["Rogue"] = "盜賊",
 ["Role poll"] = "職責確認",
 ["Rooted"] = "被定身",
 ["Routing & Schema"] = "路由與架構方案",
 ["Rules"] = "規則",
 ["Run Wizard"] = "執行精靈",
 ["Run cadence (steps/s)"] = "奔跑踏步節奏 (步/秒)",
 ["Same fall-duration proxy as \"Landed\", just a higher threshold and a heavier mode."] = "採用與「著地」相同的墜落時間估算機制，僅門檻更高且模式更為厚重。",
 ["Same polled mechanism as \"Confirmation popup appeared\". Untested."] = "與「確認彈出視窗出現」相同的輪詢機制。未經測試。",
 ["Same source as weaponSwingMain above — PLAYER_SWING, filtered to the OffHand swing type. Silent if you're not dual-wielding. Parry haste has never affected off-hand timing, so that correction does not apply here even on the fallback estimator."] = "與上方的 weaponSwingMain 來源相同——PLAYER_SWING，並過濾為副手 (OffHand) 揮擊類型。未雙持武器時保持靜音。招架加速從未影響副手時機，因此即使在後備估算器上也不套用該修正。",
 ["Same weight and shape as the vendor, mailbox and bank cues alongside it — all four are \"a window you walked up to has opened\", and they deliberately feel alike rather than each inventing a signature."] = "與並列的商人、信箱及銀行提示具有相同的比重與形態——四者皆屬於「走近並開啟視窗」，刻意維持相似體感，而非各自發明專屬特徵。",
 ["Sandstorm / Gale intensity"] = "沙塵暴 / 強風強度",
 ["Save & Start Playing"] = "儲存並開始遊戲",
 ["Scales both the bed and the strikes for %s, before the two shared strengths above."] = "在上方的兩個共用強度之前，按比例縮放 %s 的持續底震與敲擊震動。",
 ["Scales this cue on top of the overall intensity on the Pulse page."] = "在 Pulse 主頁面的整體強度之上，按比例縮放此提示。",
 ["School lockouts are frequent in melee-heavy content. Off by default because a cue every kick you eat can crowd out the ones that mean you cannot act at all."] = "在近戰密集的戰鬥中法系封鎖相當頻繁。預設關閉，因為每次被斷法都產生震動提示可能會掩蓋那些導致你完全無法行動的關鍵提示。",
 ["Scored by how long you were airborne, not by fall damage — that number is unreadable. A short hop stays silent below the threshold."] = "以滯空時間進行判定，而非墜落傷害——該數值無法被讀取。門檻以下的短暫跳躍將保持靜音。",
 ["Search %d cues..."] = "搜尋 %d 個提示...",
 ["Second steepening point — the steepest segment of all, climbing to heartRateCritical by zero breath. Requested live 2026-09-16 as ~15% breath remaining."] = "第二個陡峭轉折點——所有區段中最陡峭的一段，在呼吸耗盡時爬升至危急心率 (heartRateCritical)。於 2026-09-16 實機請求設定在剩餘 ~15% 呼吸時間。",
 ["Second-harmonic Stokes drift shaping. 0.0 is a pure symmetric sine wave; higher values create a sharp, steep crest and an elongated trough, matching real fluid gravity waves."] = "二次諧波斯托克斯漂流 (Stokes drift) 波形塑造。0.0 為純對稱正弦波；較高數值會產生尖銳陡峭的波峰與平緩拉長的波谷，符合真實流體重力波特性。",
 ["Second-harmonic content, which is what makes a stroke feel like pull-then-glide rather than a symmetric swell. Six earlier tuning rounds all felt \"rough\" because they modulated the amplitude of a constant; a pure sine cannot express this asymmetry and that is most likely why. 0 reverts to a plain swell."] = "二次諧波成分，這正是賦予划水動作「划水加速－順勢滑行」體感的核心，而非對稱的單純湧動。前六輪調校體感皆顯「粗糙」，因為當時僅調變常數的振幅；純正弦波無法表現出這種不對稱性，而這極可能就是原因所在。設為 0 則還原為單純的湧浪。",
 ["Second: find out what your controller can do"] = "第二步：測試你的控制器能做些什麼",
 ["Secondary resource full"] = "次要資源已滿",
 ["Seconds between drowning damage pulses while submerged with zero breath."] = "在完全失去氣息潛水時，溺水傷害脈衝之間的間隔秒數。",
 ["Sensory radar for survival: immediate physical warnings when taking damage, getting critically hit, deflecting attacks, being healed, receiving debuffs, threat changes, or losing control."] = "生存專用的感官雷達：在承受傷害、受到致命一擊、偏斜攻擊、受到治療、獲得減益效果、仇恨改變或失去控制時提供即時實體警報。",
 ["Sensory spatial awareness when aiming and selecting units:\n• |cffffffffTarget Lock & Switch:|r Distinct click when acquiring a new target or cycling units.\n• |cffffffffFocus Target:|r Physical confirmation when assigning or swapping your focus target.\n• |cffffffffSoft Interaction:|r Tactile blip when your controller reticle aligns with an interactable NPC."] = "瞄準與選取單位時的空間體感感知：\n· |cffffffff目標鎖定與切換：|r 取得新目標或輪替切換單位時發出清晰點擊感。\n· |cffffffff專注目標：|r 指定或替換專注目標時提供實體確認感。\n· |cffffffff軟性互動：|r 控制器準星對準可互動 NPC 時發出觸覺輕響。",
 ["Set Floor"] = "設定起轉門檻",
 ["Set but not in force: |cffffd100%s|r. A more specific rule above is winning — clear it to let these take over."] = "已設定但未生效：|cffffd100%s|r。上方更特定的規則優先——清除該規則即可讓此項生效。",
 ["Set for Spec"] = "為專精設定",
 ["Setup Summary"] = "設定摘要",
 ["Shaman"] = "薩滿",
 ["Shapeshift form changed"] = "變形形態已變更",
 ["Shares its pulse pattern with the target cue. If your focus is also your target, you get one cue rather than two."] = "與目標提示共用相同的脈衝模式。若專注目標同時也是你的當前目標，你只會感受到一次提示而非兩次。",
 ["Shares its shape with \"Learned a new spell\" on purpose — both are the same moment to a player, just in different systems."] = "刻意與「學會新法術」共用相同的波形——對玩家而言兩者是相同的時刻，只是存在於不同的系統中。",
 ["Shares the social-pull limitation of the threat-rising cue."] = "與仇恨上升提示共用社交連帶拉怪 (social-pull) 的相同限制。",
 ["Sharp high kick layered with heavy low kick and rumble decay."] = "清脆的輕震衝量疊加沉重的重震衝量，並伴隨漸弱餘震。",
 ["Show a Play button on every cue"] = "在每個提示旁顯示播放按鈕",
 ["Show minimap icon"] = "顯示小地圖圖示",
 ["Show per-cue detail controls"] = "顯示個別提示的詳細控制項",
 ["Shows only the page switches and this page. Every cue keeps its own settings; turn this off to get every page back exactly as it was."] = "僅顯示頁面總開關以及本頁面。每個提示都會保留其各自的設定；關閉此項即可完全恢復所有頁面的原貌。",
 ["Shuttle"] = "穿梭",
 ["Silenced"] = "被沉默",
 ["Simple view"] = "簡潔檢視",
 ["Simulates real fluid swell physics via harmonic wave synthesis: a slow, rhythmic rise into a steep wave crest, followed by a gentle glide into the trough. Driven primarily by the heavy slow motor with high-motor crest spray at peak amplitude. Automatically targets ocean and coastal waters unless configured to run in all swimming water."] = "透過諧波合成模擬真實流體湧浪物理效果：緩慢且具節奏地升至陡峭波峰，隨後平緩滑入波谷。主要由重震馬達驅動，並在振幅峰值時由輕震馬達呈現浪花飛沫。除非設定為適用於所有游泳水域，否則自動鎖定海洋與沿岸水域。",
 ["Skinning"] = "剝皮",
 ["Skyriding / Gliding Thrust"] = "馭龍術 / 滑翔推進",
 ["Slow, harmonic oceanic gravity swells and coastal tides while submerged in deep oceans."] = "潛入深海時，產生緩慢而和諧的海洋重力海湧與海岸潮汐感。",
 ["Slow, rhythmic breathing expansion wave keeping you aware of your stealth state."] = "緩慢、具節奏感的呼吸起伏波形，讓你持續感知自己的潛行狀態。",
 ["Snap"] = "彈響",
 ["Snappy & Taps"] = "清脆敲擊",
 ["Snow intensity"] = "降雪強度",
 ["Social & Group"] = "社交與隊伍",
 ["Social & Group Communication"] = "社交與隊伍溝通",
 ["Soft target interact"] = "互動軟目標",
