 ["Switch to this profile"] = "切換至此設定檔",
 ["Switches every cue on the Casting page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一鍵開啟或關閉「施法」頁面上的所有提示。每個提示仍會保留其各自的底層設定。",
 ["Switches every cue on the Character & Status page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一鍵開啟或關閉「角色與狀態」頁面上的所有提示。每個提示仍會保留其各自的底層設定。",
 ["Switches every cue on the Combat page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一次開啟或關閉「戰鬥」頁面上的所有提示。底層每個提示仍保留其獨立設定。",
 ["Switches every cue on the Control & Threat page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一次開啟或關閉「控場與仇恨」頁面上的所有提示。底層每個提示仍保留其獨立設定。",
 ["Switches every cue on the Controller Interactions page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一次切換「控制器互動」頁面上的所有提示開關。各提示在底層仍會保留各自獨立的設定。",
 ["Switches every cue on the Interface & Accessibility page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一鍵開啟或關閉「介面與無障礙」頁面上的所有提示。每個提示仍會保留其各自的底層設定。",
 ["Switches every cue on the Movement & Travel page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一鍵開啟或關閉「移動與旅行」頁面上的所有提示。每個提示仍會保留其各自的底層設定。",
 ["Switches every cue on the Social & Group page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一鍵開啟或關閉「社交與隊伍」頁面上的所有提示。每個提示仍會保留其各自的底層設定。",
 ["Switches every cue on the Target & Focus page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一鍵開啟或關閉「目標與專注目標」頁面上的所有提示。每個提示仍會保留其各自的底層設定。",
 ["Switches every cue on the World & Environment page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一鍵開啟或關閉「世界與環境」頁面上的所有提示。每個提示仍會保留其各自的底層設定。",
 ["TRADE_SKILL_CRAFT_BEGIN via Core/CastActivity.lua. Untested — no crafting cue has ever existed in this addon, so nothing here has been felt. Off by default."] = "透過 Core/CastActivity.lua 處理 TRADE_SKILL_CRAFT_BEGIN。尚未測試——此插件此前從未有過製造提示，因此此處的所有內容皆未經實機體驗。預設關閉。",
 ["Tactile sensations for living in the world of Azeroth:\n• |cffffffffLoot Drops & Currency:|r Feel items and gold collected into your bags.\n• |cffffffffQuests & Turn-ins:|r Physical confirmation upon accepting and completing objectives.\n• |cffffffffProgression:|r Rewarding celebration pulses for leveling up, achievements, and XP gains."] = "漫遊艾澤拉斯世界的觸覺體感：\n· |cffffffff掉落物品與貨幣：|r 感受物品與金幣收入背包的觸感。\n· |cffffffff任務與回報：|r 接取與完成任務目標時提供實體回饋感。\n· |cffffffff角色成長：|r 升級、獲得成就與獲得經驗值時產生獎勵慶祝脈衝。",
 ["Tailoring"] = "裁縫",
