 ["Targeted by enemy"] = "被敵人選為目標",
 ["Targeting"] = "目標鎖定",
 ["Tempo at zero breath remaining — the panic end of the climb, reached only in the final stretch below lateBreathThreshold."] = "剩餘呼吸歸零時的節奏——爬升的恐慌終點，僅在低於 lateBreathThreshold 的最後階段觸及。",
 ["Tempo from dangerStartThreshold down to midBreathThreshold — a real bradycardic rate (the diving reflex actually slows the heart at first, requested live 2026-09-16), not an elevated one."] = "從 dangerStartThreshold 下降至 midBreathThreshold 的節奏——真實的潛水反射心搏過緩心率（潛水反射最初實際上會減緩心跳，於 2026-09-16 實測要求），而非偏高心率。",
 ["Temporarily disabled: UNIT_PING_PIN_ADDED is registration-restricted by Blizzard on WoW Forever / 12.x."] = "暫時停用：Blizzard 在 WoW Forever / 12.x 上限制了 UNIT_PING_PIN_ADDED 的事件註冊。",
 ["Tension"] = "張力",
