 ["The Accessibility section"] = "「無障礙」分類",
 ["The Cue Index directory"] = "提示索引目錄",
 ["The _QUIET variant covers failures the game prints no error for, so this can fire with nothing visible on screen."] = "_QUIET 變體涵蓋了遊戲未輸出錯誤訊息的失敗情況，因此在螢幕上沒有任何可見提示時也可能觸發。",
 ["The catch-all. Enum.PlayerInteractionType has 81 values and most are retail systems a classic-shaped roster never meets; anything unmapped lands here rather than being silent, which also means a window type added to the client later is covered with no change to Pulse. Turn it on with /pulse debug to find out which types your client actually sends. Untested."] = "通用過濾機制。Enum.PlayerInteractionType 擁有 81 個列舉值，其中大部分是經典版名單從未接觸過的正服系統；任何未對應的項目都會歸類於此而非保持靜音，這也意味著未來客戶端新增的視窗類型無須修改 Pulse 即可獲得支援。可使用 /pulse debug 開啟以查閱客戶端實際發送的類型。未經測試。",
 ["The effort of pulling yourself through water — a rhythmic hydrodynamic stroke that quickens and hardens with movement speed."] = "在水中划動前進的阻力——具備節奏感的流體動力划水動作，隨著移動速度加快而變得更加急促與強勁。",
 ["The experimental section"] = "實驗性分類",
 ["The fallback for any character with no rule of its own — including characters you have not logged into yet. Set this to the profile you mostly want, then override the handful of characters that differ."] = "任何沒有專屬規則之角色的備用設定——包含你尚未登入過的角色。將此設定為你最常使用的設定檔，隨後僅需單獨覆蓋少數不同的角色即可。",
 ["The lightest possible tick when a conversation window opens with any NPC."] = "與任何 NPC 開啟對話視窗時，產生最為輕微的提示震動。",
 ["The master switch for this page. Also on the Casting page, where the cue lives alongside the other casting cues."] = "本頁面的總開關。同時也存在於「施法」頁面中，與該頁面中的其他施法提示並列。",
 ["The most promising cue here: a radial is an analog sweep through discrete stops, which is exactly what haptics are good at, and it's the one that could let you pick a segment without looking. Blizzard already change-gates this and applies its own stick hysteresis, so it should not fire continuously while you hold a direction. Untested whether the rate still feels like too much."] = "此處最具潛力的提示：環形選單是在離散停頓點之間進行類比滑動，這正是觸覺反饋的拿手好戲，亦能讓你無需注視螢幕即可盲選扇區。暴雪原生已對此進行狀態變更過濾並套用搖桿遲滯機制，因此朝特定方向按住時不應持續觸發。觸發頻率是否仍顯過密則尚未經完整實機測試。",
 ["The other edge of the same CURSOR_CHANGED transition. Fires whether the item was placed somewhere or the drag was simply cancelled — the event doesn't distinguish, and nothing readable does."] = "同一個 CURSOR_CHANGED 轉換的另一端。無論是物品被放置於某處，還是拖曳動作被單純取消皆會觸發——該事件無法區分，且沒有任何可讀取的資訊能加以分辨。",
 ["The smallest value that makes this motor actually spin. Anything above zero is remapped into the range above this floor, so a quiet cue still moves the mass instead of dying silently. Zero input still means completely off. Use \"Ramp\" below to find your controller's real figure."] = "能讓此馬達真正起轉的最小數值。任何大於零的數值都會重新對應至此起轉門檻之上的範圍，使微弱的提示仍能帶動配重塊轉動而非悄然無聲。零輸入仍代表完全關閉。請使用下方的「爬升測試」找出你控制器的真實數值。",
 ["The standard authored baseline. Balanced game-feel across combat, environment, movement, and alerts."] = "標準官方原創基準。在戰鬥、環境、移動與警報之間取得平衡的遊戲體感。",
 ["The work itself while you craft — a bed for the length of it, with the profession's own rhythm struck on top. A hammer for blacksmithing, a pick for mining, nothing percussive for tailoring or enchanting."] = "製造過程本身的工作體感——在整個過程中持續的基底震動，並疊加各專業自身的敲擊節奏。鍛造是鐵鎚敲擊，採礦是十字鎬敲打，裁縫或附魔則無敲擊衝擊感。",
 ["There is no way to detect which motors a controller actually drives — pick a schema above, then play a few modes to find out."] = "無法由系統自動偵測控制器實際驅動了哪些馬達——請於上方選取一個震動配置，然後試玩幾種模式來親手確認。",
 ["These strike. The shape and the rate come from the craft — a hammer is slower and heavier than a pick — and the last blow lands on completion."] = "這些會產生敲擊感。其敲擊形態與頻率取決於製造項目——鐵鎚比十字鎬更慢且更沉重——而最後一下敲擊會在製造完成時落下。",
 ["This character"] = "目前角色",
 ["This character reports no specialization, so there is no per-specialization rule to set. The row appears by itself on a character that has one."] = "目前角色無專精資訊，因此無可設定的個別專精規則。當角色擁有專精時該列將自動顯示。",
 ["This specialization"] = "目前專精",
