 ["This specialization (%s)"] = "此專精 (%s)",
 ["Threat"] = "仇恨",
 ["Threat loss/warning, heavy hits taken, defensive cooldowns, crowd control, enemy kick windows"] = "仇恨遺失／警告、承受重創、防禦冷卻技能、控場效果、敵方斷法時機",
 ["Threat lost"] = "仇恨遺失",
 ["Threat rising"] = "仇恨上升",
 ["Threat, mitigations, and CC"] = "仇恨、減傷與控場",
 ["Three rhythmic thuds."] = "三次有節奏的沉重撞擊。",
 ["Three-stage rising tension building on the low motor."] = "重震馬達上呈現三段漸強的緊張感積蓄。",
 ["Thrill curve (high)"] = "俯衝快感曲線（輕震）",
 ["Thrill peak (high)"] = "俯衝快感峰值（輕震）",
 ["Thrum"] = "轟鳴",
 ["Thud"] = "悶擊",
 ["Thump"] = "重捶",
 ["Tick"] = "滴答",
 ["Time in seconds for a complete wave cycle. Real oceanic swells roll every 8 to 12 seconds (~0.10 Hz). Shorter periods feel like choppy coastal chop; longer periods feel like open-ocean rollers."] = "一個完整海浪週期的秒數。現實中的大洋湧浪每 8 到 12 秒湧動一次 (~0.10 Hz)。週期較短感覺像近岸碎浪；週期較長感覺像遠洋起伏巨浪。",
 ["Tracked cooldown ready"] = "追蹤的冷卻已就緒",
 ["Trade opened"] = "交易視窗已開啟",
 ["Trainer window opened"] = "訓練師視窗已開啟",
 ["Triggers, modes, and motor tuning"] = "觸發器、模式與馬達調校",
 ["Triple Tap"] = "三擊",
 ["Try Texture"] = "測試震感",
 ["Tuned for HD Rumble voice-coil actuators"] = "專為 HD 震動音圈致動器調校",
 ["Tuned for heavy chassis damping (+10% Low motor gain)"] = "針對高機殼阻尼調校（+10% 重震馬達增益）",
 ["Tuned for trackpad & chassis LRA haptics"] = "專為觸控板與機身 LRA 觸覺回饋調校",
 ["Turn off every cue in the active profile in one sweep (useful for quiet debugging)."] = "一鍵關閉使用中設定檔中的所有提示（對靜音偵錯非常實用）。",
 ["Turn on every cue in the active profile in one sweep (useful for testing/debugging)."] = "一鍵開啟使用中設定檔中的所有提示（對測試/偵錯非常實用）。",
 ["Turn whole pages of cues on or off. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath: switching a page back on restores exactly what was there."] = "整頁開啟或關閉提示。每個提示在底層均會保留各自的設定：重新開啟頁面將完全恢復先前的狀態。",
 ["Two crisp ticks when a cooldown the built-in Cooldown Manager is tracking comes off cooldown."] = "內建冷卻管理器追蹤的技能結束冷卻時，產生兩次清脆的提示震動。",
 ["Two heavier hits with a gap between them."] = "兩次較重的敲擊，中間帶有明顯間隔。",
 ["Two kinds of trigger: pulses and textures"] = "兩類觸發器：脈衝與持續質感",
 ["Two rhythmic thuds."] = "兩次有節奏的沉重撞擊。",
 ["Two separate addons exist alongside Pulse, each with its own slash command — neither is required, and neither changes anything Pulse itself does.\n\n**PulseChecklist** (/pulsecheck or /pcheck) opens a standalone checklist window listing every trigger, for tracking which ones you've actually confirmed feel right on your own hardware.\n\n**PulseDebug** (/pdebug or /pd) opens an interactive diagnostic window with live telemetry — inspect currently blended layers, monitor real-time channel output, review a timestamped event log, and inspect module states."] = "除了 Pulse 本體外，還隨附兩個獨立插件，各自擁有專屬指令——兩者皆非必選，且都不會改變 Pulse 本身的運作方式。\n\n**PulseChecklist**（/pulsecheck 或 /pcheck）可開啟獨立的核取清單視窗，列出所有觸發器，供你追蹤哪些提示已在你的實體硬體上確認體感良好。\n\n**PulseDebug**（/pdebug 或 /pd）可開啟具有即時遙測數據的互動式診斷視窗——檢視當前混合的震動層、監控即時聲道輸出、回顧帶有時間戳記的事件紀錄，以及檢視模組狀態。",
 ["Two soft ticks when the action bar pages to a different set of abilities."] = "快捷列翻頁至另一組技能時，產生兩次柔和的提示震動。",
 ["Two soft ticks when you page the radial left or right with the shoulder buttons."] = "使用肩鍵向左或向右翻動環形選單時，產生兩次柔和的提示震動。",
 ["Two soft ticks when you switch tabs inside a panel — Character, Spellbook, the map's zone tabs, and so on."] = "在面板內切換分頁標籤時發出兩聲柔和微震——例如角色、法術書、地圖的區域分頁等。",
 ["Two solid hits when an item attaches to the cursor."] = "當物品拿起至游標時，產生兩下紮實的打擊感。",
 ["Two solid hits when you mount."] = "上坐騎時產生兩聲紮實的敲擊震動。",
 ["Two taps when the guild bank opens — heavier than the personal bank, because it is a bigger door."] = "公會銀行開啟時產生兩下輕敲——比個人銀行更沉重，因為門更巨大。",
 ["UI focus moved"] = "介面焦點移動",
 ["UI navigation hit an edge"] = "介面導覽觸碰邊緣",
 ["UI panel closed"] = "介面面板已關閉",
 ["UI panel opened"] = "介面面板已開啟",
 ["Underwater boost"] = "水下增強",
 ["Underwater breath texture"] = "水下呼吸質感",
 ["Untested whether this also fires on every instant-cast press rather than only real cast-bar completions — if so, it'll feel far too frequent to read as \"that landed\" specifically. Check before relying on it."] = "未經測試每次按下瞬發技能是否也會觸發，而非僅在實際施法條讀條完成時觸發——若是前者，震動將過於頻繁而無法準確傳達「技能命中」的感受。依賴此項前請先進行驗證。",
 ["Untested — the interruptedBy value itself is confirmed against Blizzard's own casting-bar code, not live. What's NOT confirmed: whether interruptedBy comes back secret for your own channel (the event is flagged SecretWhenUnitSpellCastRestricted in Blizzard's API docs). If this never fires, that's the first thing to check, not a sign the logic above is wrong."] = "尚未測試——interruptedBy 數值本身已依暴雪自身的施法條程式碼確認，但未經實機驗證。尚未確認的是：你自身的引導法術之 interruptedBy 是否會回傳私密值 (Secret Value)（該事件在暴雪 API 文件中標記為 SecretWhenUnitSpellCastRestricted）。如果此提示從未觸發，這應是優先排查的事項，而非代表上述邏輯有誤。",
 ["Untested."] = "未經測試。",
 ["Untested: this fires for a Skyriding ascend too, on top of glideThrust's own continuous texture easing in right after — may read as a clean \"liftoff, then flight\" or as a double-hit. Try it before assuming either."] = "未經測試：此效果在馭龍術升空躍升時亦會觸發，疊加在隨後緩入的 glideThrust 持續質感之上——可能會被感知為俐落的「離地騰空，隨後飛行」，或是兩次連續衝擊。在做出定論前建議先行試用。",
 ["Urgent repeating cardiac 'lub-dub' rhythm in sync with screen warnings below 20% health."] = "生命值低於 20% 時，與螢幕警告同步的急促重複雙擊心跳節奏 ('lub-dub')。",
 ["Use the old estimator"] = "使用舊版估算演算法",
 ["Use when the high motor produces nothing you can feel at all. Everything collapses onto the low motor. If it works but is just weak, use Standard and raise its Strength on the Controller calibration page instead."] = "當輕震馬達完全無法產生任何可感知的震動時使用。所有訊號將合併至重震馬達。若能運作但偏弱，請改用「標準震動」並在「控制器校準」頁面中調高其強度。",
 ["Use when the low motor produces nothing you can feel at all. Everything collapses onto the high motor. If the low motor works but is just weak, use Standard and raise its Strength on the Controller calibration page instead."] = "當重震馬達完全無法產生任何可感知的震動時使用。所有訊號將合併至輕震馬達。若重震馬達能運作但偏弱，請改用「標準震動」並在「控制器校準」頁面中調高其強度。",
