 ["What the game is doing, felt through the controller."] = "透過控制器體會遊戲中的一舉一動。",
 ["What this does"] = "功能說明",
 ["When mobs are pulled socially — aggroing because a neighbour was pulled — the game often reports status 0 even though you have aggro."] = "當怪物被連帶引怪拉到時（因鄰近的怪物被引而產生仇恨），遊戲往往回報仇恨狀態為 0，即便你實際上持有仇恨。",
 ["When set to 1, restricts the rolling swell to ocean bodies, coasts, seas, and deep-water fatigue zones (English clients only; non-English clients play swell in all swimming water). Set to 0 to feel ocean swells in all swimming water."] = "設定為 1 時，將翻湧的湧浪限制於海洋、海岸、海域與深水疲勞區域（僅限英文客戶端；非英文客戶端將在所有游泳水域播放湧浪）。設定為 0 則可在所有游泳水域中感受海洋湧浪。",
 ["Which controller is this?"] = "這是哪一款控制器？",
 ["Which controller you are holding. Picking one changes nothing on its own — press Apply below to load its starting values. These are starting points reasoned from what kind of actuators each controller uses, not measurements: Ramp is what measures YOUR controller, and whatever you enter afterwards wins."] = "你當前手持的控制器型號。單純選取不會改變任何設定——請點擊下方的「套用」以載入其起始數值。這些數值是依據各控制器採用的致動器類型推導出的起點，並非精確測量值：使用「爬升測試」才能測量「你的」控制器實際狀況，且隨後輸入的數值擁有最高優先權。",
 ["Which of the preset shapes this specific cue plays when it fires. \""] = "此提示觸發時播放哪種預設震動形態。「",
 ["Which physical motors each cue drives. Start with Standard Rumble, then calibrate the motors below."] = "每個提示驅動哪些實體馬達。建議從「標準震動」開始，然後在下方校準馬達。",
 ["Which physical motors each trigger drives. Try one, test a mode below, keep the one you can feel."] = "每個觸發器驅動哪些實體馬達。嘗試一種並測試下方的模式，保留你能清晰感知的設定。",
 ["Which profile to use right now. This writes to whichever rule is currently in force, so picking here always changes what you are actually using rather than editing a rule something more specific is overriding."] = "目前使用的設定檔。這會直接寫入目前生效的規則，因此在此選擇始終會改變你實際使用的設定，而不會編輯被更高優先級規則覆寫的內容。",
 ["Which saved cue configuration is active on this character. Every cue's on/off, its intensity and its mode override belong to the profile picked here; the master switch, the schema and the calibration stay global."] = "此角色目前啟用的已儲存提示配置。各提示的開關、強度與模式覆寫皆歸屬於此處所選的設定檔；總開關、震動配置與校準設定則保持全域共用。",
 ["Whisper received"] = "收到密語",
