 ["World dialogs, ambient weather, merchant/mail"] = "世界對話、環境天氣、商人/郵件",
 ["World of Warcraft ignores controllers entirely until you turn them on, and this is off by default. Pairing the controller to your computer is not enough — the game has to be told separately.\n\nType this into chat, then restart the game:\n\n    /console GamePadEnable 1\n\nUntil that is done nothing here can work, and nothing will warn you. If Pulse seems completely dead, check this first."] = "《魔獸世界》在手動開啟控制器支援之前會完全忽略控制器，且此選項預設為關閉。僅將控制器與電腦配對是不夠的——必須另外在遊戲中啟用。\n\n請在對話框輸入以下指令，隨後重新啟動遊戲：\n\n    /console GamePadEnable 1\n\n在完成此操作前，本插件的所有功能皆無法運作，且不會發出任何警告。若 Pulse 看似完全毫無反應，請優先檢查此設定。",
